<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Uyohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Uyohana aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uyohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Uyoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uyohana</para>
  <para style="mt2">aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Uyohana</para>
  <para style="ip">Awu Uyohana atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ, unga atsɛng umgbɔ adɛyiwe ugɛ Uyesu unga awu Urhɛm ukpu ugbagbaa ukpu Unum, ukpurukpi &lt;&lt;uku uwe uner nu usei nggu umɛn.&gt;&gt; Ru nyaku ubvur ha uku urherhe, atsɛng Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyɛrɛ ngge itsú abika avarha ngge ama awe ru imangmang ugɛ Uyesu awu uwuku ufɔrh ha umbɔ aka abemuwa, ungwɛ̃ Unum hã, nu ugɛ ru ubok imangmangmbɔ ru unga, umbɔ ama akpo urhɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:31">20.31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Uyohana aka amaa idɛyiwe ugɛ Uyesu unga awu Urhɛm ukpu ugbagbaa ukpu Unum, agbɛr aki inggbaashia arherha arherhe ri itsi ikpũ ídzeu iyiriyɛ iki idɛyiwe ugɛ Uyesu awu uwuku ufɔrh ha umbɔ aka abemuwa, ungwɛ̃ Unum hã. Akirakɛ aka adɔsa ru agbɛr akɛrɛ ha, arherha arherhe ri itsi abinkɛ aka adzeka ru ídzeu ha. Agbɛr akɛrɛ adɛyiwe ugɛ abɔɔ awe ru imangmang ru Uyesu na awe abika adɔsa unga, bɔr abɔɔ akpɛ̃ɛ̃ unga na ashimbɔ ri imangmang. Arherhe aki <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13-17">13—17</ref></char> arherha arherhe ri itsi iwɛrhɛ Uyesu nggu angwɛ̃ imesanga ru utsuu ha umbɔ aka adzur unga, nu irhɛm iyiki ifita ru umbɔ ru utsuu ha. Arherhe aki imaataka ikinanake ru ubvur uwurɛ, arherhuke arherhe ri itsi idzidzur Uyesu nu ufainga, akpenga ri igãrhãmau ucucii nu isisoknga ra akpe, nu unga aka adzeka ra ateu angwɛ̃ imesanga ri ivangyɛ unga aka asok ra akpe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Uyohana arherha arherhe ri itsi izũwã iyi urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa ru ubok Ukiristo. Izũwã hã itirhi icɛrɛ nu iyiriyɛ iki iba ra abirabɛ aka awe ru imangmang ugɛ Uyesu unga awu utsĩndĩ hã, idzidzɛrhe ha, nu urhɛ ha.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Uyohana <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1.1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima nu abi itser Uyesu abi inggbaashia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1.19-51</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Itser Uyesu unga aka atɔ̃ ra awiya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2.1—12.50</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Uyesu agbisha adzɛu akpenga <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 13:1-17:26">13.1—17.26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Akpe Uyesu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 18:1-19:42">18.1—19.42</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isisok Uyesu ra akpe <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 20:1-21:25">20.1—21.25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Urhɛm hã uwu uner</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Ri inggbaashia Urhɛm uwekpɔ, Urhɛm hã uwu nggu Unum, urhɛm hã uwu Unum. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Unga awu nggu Unum ri inggbaashia.<verse eid="JHN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Awu ru uboknga umbɔ aka amuna abina kishoo. Agɛ unga ashia, ubin usi ímunukpɔ ra abin hã umbɔ aka amuna. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Ru unga urhɛ uwemgbɔ, urhɛ ha awu irhirhang ra anera kishoo. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Irhirhang hã irhang ru uzĩ, bɔr uzĩ hã usi ihwɛngkpɔ ngge.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Unera nuwɔ Unum aka adene unga aba. Itsoknga igburh Uyohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Unga aba awu ideka ri irhirhang hã, nggee ru uboknga anera kishoo ama awe ru imangmang. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Unga asi iwea irhirhang hã. Unga aba awu ideka irhirhang hã ukpekũ. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Uwu ha aka awe irhirhang iyi idzidzɛrhe aka abanga ru upfung. Unga aka idzowe irhirhang ru anera kishoo ru upfung.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Urhɛm hã uwe ru upfung. Upfunga umuna ru uboknga, bɔr upfung hã usi ihwɛngkpɔ unga. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Unga aba ru upfungkpi uku uwe ukpunga, bɔr anernga asi iyɛimbɔ unga. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Rimi hã kishoo abika ayɛi unga, nu abika adzowe imangmang ri itsoknga, unga adzowuka umbɔ ijee umbɔ awe angwɛ̃ Unum. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Awu Unum abema ngge iwe rimi ngge itsu umbɔ awu angwɛ̃nga, asi iwea imar iyi anera, use ikponi iyor, use isisɛng anera itsu umbɔ awu angwɛ̃ Unum.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Urhɛm hã uwu unera nu usei nggu umɛn. Umɛn inyãmɛn igɔngnga, igɔngyɛ iki iwu iyi unanyĩ Ungwɛ̃wi aka adzeku Utɛ. Awu nggu imimuta nu idzidzɛrhe.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Uyohana adzowuka ideka ri itsinga. Atsarhi irhaknga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uwɛrɛ awu unga hã umum iki irherha arherhe ri itsinga ri ivangyɛ umum iki ĩgɔr ugɛ, &lt;Uwuruwi aka iba ru undzingmum ananga umum, ubinkutsu awea umbɔ adɔrha amar umum.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Umɛn kishoo iyɛi idorh irhɛirhɛ iki idzeku imimutanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Adzaa Íkpem ru ubok Umusa, bɔr imimuta nu idzidzɛrhe idzeku ubok Uyesu Ukiristo. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Unera anasi inyãã Unum, bɔr unanyi Ungwɛ̃nga adɛyiwa umɛn iwiwe Unum. Unanyi Ungwɛ̃ hã akhapa nggu Unum Utɛ, unga itsikamnga awu Unum.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyohana atsɛyinga iwe Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Umat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Umar 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Irh 3.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Ideka Uyohana iyɛ, ri ivangyɛ abi ijee Uyahuda ru Urusharhima adene abika adzowe idɛm-Num abɔɔ nu abi Urhawi ru Uyohana arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu ungamɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Uyohana adekuwe umbɔ ra awiya agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea umum iwu Ukiristo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Umbɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu ungamɔ? Awu ungo uwu Uirhiya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Umbɔ arhusa ikɛi agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ungo uwu uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num hã Umusa aka arherhe ugɛ ibanga?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ude ungo uwu ungamɔ? Udɛyiwa ubinkpi umɛn iki izĩ idɛyiwe abika adena umɛn. Ungo udɛyiwa umɛn use ri itsingo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Uyohana akũ arherhe uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num Uishaya agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu umum iwu urhɛmkpi uku idũwã ra arhum ugɛ, &lt;Àka agbishu utsĩndĩ Uteijee uku urhirhiki.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Uish 40.3</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Mɔcɛ abi Ufarisi ha umbɔ aka adene, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>arhusu Uyohana agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu ungo usorhuwe ubɔtisima uba ungo usi iweɔ Ukiristo, ikɛi ungo usi iweɔ Uirhiya, ikɛi ungo usi iweɔ uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num hã Umusa aka arherhe ugɛ ibanga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Uyohana agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum isorhuwe ubɔtisima nggu amɛ̃, bɔr uwɔɔ ruwɔ ru umbi, uwuruwi umbi aka asi ihwɛngmbi unga. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Unga awuri iba ru undzingmum, uwuruwi umum isi ímɛ̃mum igarhuwe arhi abadaknga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Kishoo akɛrɛ ha akorhe ru Ubetani, ugar Azɛ̃ Urdun, anangkɛ Uyohana aki isorhuwe ubɔtisima.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Ukpe uku usar, Uyohana anyã Uyesu aka azɛ̃rhã aba ra anangnga, Uyohana agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka anyã, Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi Unum uwuruwi aka itsũwe arhim upfunga! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Uwɛrɛ awu unga hã nuwi umum iki ĩgɔr ĩgɛ, &lt;Uwɔɔ ruwɔ aba ru undzingmum ananga umum, ubinkutsu, unga aka awea umbɔ adɔrha amar umum.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Umum isi ihwɛng unga, bɔr umum iki isorhu ubɔtisima nggu amɛ̃ ngge ítsu abi Uisrairha ama ahwɛng unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Mɔcɛ Uyohana adzowe ideka iyɛrɛ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum inyã Ipfu-Num iki icipuwa ru nyaku unurhɛu ra afã, iba isei nu unga. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Umum isi ihwɛng unga, bɔr Unum uwuku udena umum ĩba isorhu ubɔtisima nggu amɛ̃, unga agɔr umum agɛ, &lt;Utsakwi ungo uku unyã Ipfu-Num icipuwa iseingge nu unga, awu unga hã nuwɔ aka isorhuwe ubɔtisima nggu Ipfu Isarsatangge.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Umum inyãmum ngge iki iwe rimi hã ni iwemum ri ideka ugɛ unga awu Ungwɛ̃ Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Angwɛ̃ imesa Uyesu abi inggbaashia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Umat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Umar 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:2-11">Irh 5.2-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Ukpe uku usar ikɛi Uyohana adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu angwɛ̃ imesanga avaa. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Unga aka anyã Uyesu aka azɛ̃rhã atɔng, unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka anyã, Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi Unum!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Angwɛ̃ imesa ha ikivarhambɔ aka agũ arherhe Uyohana, umbɔ adɔsu Uyesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Uyesu aka adzipa arhi undzingnga, anyã umbɔ aka adɔsa unga, unga arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi abee use?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Rabbi, ungo usei ri inɛɛ?&gt;&gt; Agben &lt;&lt;Rabbi&gt;&gt; agburh &lt;&lt;A umarhem.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka aba, umbi awuri inyãmbi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">Nggee angwɛ̃ imesa ha azĩ anyã anangkɛ unga aka asei. Umbɔ atsĩ umɔ ra akara annaa aki urhɛɛ na asei nggu unga unum hã.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Uandarawu, ungwɛ̃mbɔ Usiman Ubitru, awu umɔ ri iner ha ikivarhangge iki igũ arherhe Uyohana ri itsi Uyesu ni idɔsa unga. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Uandarawu atirha abee ungwɛ̃mbɔ Usiman, agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn iki ikpomɛn Uarhmasihu,&gt;&gt; agbena agburh &lt;&lt;Ukiristo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Unga akũ Usiman azĩã ru Uyesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Uyesu arhi unga na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu Usiman ungwɛ̃ Uyohana. Awuri iyisa ungo Ukefa,&gt;&gt; agbena aka agburh &lt;&lt;Ubitru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ayisu Ufirhibu nu Unataniyerh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Ukpe uku usar ikɛi Uyesu abee izĩ Ugarhirhi. Unga akpo Ufirhibu, agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Udɔsa umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Ufirhibu awu uner Ubetsaida, uteumbɔ Uandarawu nu Ubitru. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Ufirhibu akpo Unataniyerh, agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn iki ikpomɛn uner ha umbɔ aka atsɛng isarhanga ru ubvur Íkpem Umusa nu abvur abika asɔm Arherhu-Num. Unga awu Uyesu uner Unazarat, ungwɛ̃ Uyusuf.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Unataniyerh arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubin uku uze udɛ̃ɛ̃ udzekpɔ ru Unazarat?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Ufirhibu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba unyã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Uyesu aka anyã Unataniyerh aka aba ru unga, unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka anyã uner Uisrairha uwu idzidzɛrhe, uwuruwi aka asi igbɛrangwĩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Unataniyerh arhusu Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo ukorhu uguse nu uhwɛng umum?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum inyãmum ungo ru usĩrhũ ucucii uvorhvo, nu Ufirhibu adɔrha ayisa ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Mɔcɛ Unataniyerh agɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, ungo uwu Ungwɛ̃ Unum. Ungo uwu Uyɛrhe Uisrairha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Uyesu agɔr Unataniyerh agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubinkutsu ungo uwe ri imangmang, umum iki idɛyiwa ungo ugɛ umum inyãmum ungo ru usĩrhũ ucucii uvorhvo? Ungo uwuri inyinyãɔ abinkɛ aka anangke rimi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Unga atoma adɛyiwe unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, umbi awuri inyãmbi afã aka iyanga, ípfu itser-Num ikɛi ifũrhã ni icipa ni itsi Ungwɛ̃-Ner.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Irhowa ipfuna ru Ukana Ugarhirhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Ru unum ukpu untaar umbɔ awe ru irhowa ipfuna ru Ukana ukpu Ugarhirhi. Uya Uyesu awe umɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Aghwi Uyesu nu angwɛ̃ imesanga ri ipfuna hã. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Ivangyɛ amɛ̃ inebi aka amaa, uya Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɛ̃ inebi aka amaake.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A uya, awu ufang asi iwea ungo udɛyiwa umum ubin ukpuku ukukorhe. Ivangmum inasi ibangge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Uyanga agɔr abika atɔ̃ itser ri irhowa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka akorhe kishoo ubinkpi unga aka agɔr umbi ikikorhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Ídzor niyɔ utɔ̃ĩ iyiriyɛ umbɔ aka akũ atarh adzin aden ra anang hã. Ubɛn idzora ighangge idzum amɛ̃ itɔ̃ɔ̃ use utɔ̃ĩ. Abi Uyahuda aka isaka akũ amɛ̃ asorh ayormbɔ iyi agbeyambɔ. <figure style="fig" alt="Six water pots" file="lb00135b.tif" size="col" loc="2.6" copy="Louise Bass" ref="2.6">Ídzor utɔ̃i</figure><verse eid="JHN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Uyesu agɔr abika atɔ̃ itser ri irhowa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka atsu amɛ̃ atɔk ídzor iyɛrɛ.&gt;&gt; Nggee umbɔ atsu amɛ̃ atɔke ídzor ha uku urhɛrhɛki.<verse eid="JHN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Icɛrɛ àka ashɔyi, adzowe unggbaashi abika atɔ̃ itser irhowa ha.&gt;&gt; Umbɔ ashɔyi adzowe.<verse eid="JHN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Utei irhowa ha avupa agũ ake aka adzipa awu amɛ̃ inebi. Unga asi ihwɛngnga anangkɛ ake aka adzek, bɔr abika ashɔyi adzowe ahwɛngmbɔ. Mɔcɛ unga ayisu utsa ipfuna hã ri ibanga, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn unera aka isaka agbaashia adzowe amɛ̃ inebi aka azea na adɔrha akũ akirakɛ aka asi ikpanga azeke. Bɔr ungo uwɔkɔ amɛ̃ inebi aka azea nu udɔrhu ukũ icɛrɛ uba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Akɛrɛ ha ake awu ubin idzeu nu utsar ukpu inggbaashia ukpu Uyesu aka akorhe. Akorha ake ru Ukana ukpu Ugarhirhi. Akɛrɛ adɛyiwe igɔngnga nu angwɛ̃ imesanga atsu imangmangmbɔ ru unga.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Akɛrɛ aka amaa Uyesu asok acipa azĩ Ukafanahum, unga nu uyanga nu angwɛ̃mbɔ nu angwɛ̃ imesanga. Nggɔɔ ha umbɔ asei inuma ukunjiir.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu asare Iya-Num</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Umat 21.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Umar 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Irh 19.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Ivang Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng iyi abi Uyahuda iki iyo, Uyesu azĩ Urusharhima. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Ru ufɔm Iya-Num, unga anyã anera adɛ̃ɛ̃ igoyiwe ínak nu ídɔi nu anurhɛu. Ikɛi unga anyãã abika afaruwe uhwɛk asei umɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Nggee Uyesu akũ arhi awɛyi asharhe, akũ awayiwe kishoo anera nu ídɔi nu ínak ru ufɔm Iya-Num hã. Ikɛi unga ayii atebur iyi abika afaruwe uhwɛk ha, asituwe íshaa uhwɛkmbɔ kishoo. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɔr anera abika agoyiwe anurhɛu ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka akũ akɛrɛ apfu adzek nggimi! Niba adzipu iya Utɛmum iweke anang izɛɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga ayitu ubinkpi uku utsɛng ra Arherhu-Num ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Ibibemayɛ umum iki iwurangge ri iyango iwuri ikpĩa umum ru nyaku urha.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Amb 69.9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Mɔcɛ anggbaashi abi Uyahuda arhusu Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsar idzeu ukusong ungo iki idɛyiwa umɛn ugɛ ungo uweɔ ri ijeeyɛ iki itsu ungo ukorha akɛrɛ ha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka abupuwe Iya-Num ikɛrɛ, umum iwuri iberukũ ake ikɛi ri inuma itaar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Abi Uyahuda agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Anyanga amɛka isɔka inaa ni ímɛka utɔ̃ĩ adzin Iya-Num ikɛrɛ nu ungo ugɔr ugɛ ungo idzine ake ri inuma itaar?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Bɔr iya-Numkɛ unga aka arherhe awu iyornga. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Uyesu aka asoka akpe, angwɛ̃ imesanga ayita arherhe ha Uyesu aka arherhe. Mɔcɛ umbɔ awe ru imangmang ri itsɛng Arherhu-Num nu arherhe Uyesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Ivang Uyesu aka awe ru Urusharhima ri Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng, anera arhɛrhɛ aka anyã atsar abin idzeukɛ unga aka akorhe, umbɔ adzowe imangmang ru unga. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Bɔr Uyesu ashia ri imangmang ru umbɔ, ubinkutsu unga ahwɛnga amɛn anera kishoo. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Unga asi ibeenga unera adɛyiwe unga ubin ri itsi anera ubinkutsu unga ahwɛnga abinkɛ aka awe ra amɛn anera.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu amesuwe Unikodimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Unera nuwɔ itsoka igburh Unikodimu. Awu unggbaashi abi Uyahuda na awu utsa Ufarisi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Unga aba ru Uyesu ru untsuuka, agɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ungo uwu umarhemwi aka adzeku Unum, ubinkutsu unera asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhunga abin idzeu nu atsarkɛ ungo uku ikorhe, Unum aba asi iwea nggu unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa ungo idzidzɛrhe, aba asi imarmbɔ unera ide ivaa, asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atsĩã ri Iyɛrhe Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Unikodimu arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Abvui amar unera aguse ri ikɔ̃ uner? Idzidzɛrhe asi íbvui atsĩã ra anaa uyanga umbɔ amar unga ide ivaa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa ungo idzidzɛrhe, umbɔ aba asi imarmbɔ unera ra amɛ̃ nu Ipfu-Num, asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atsĩã Iyɛrhe Unum. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Ubinkpi unera aka amar uwu uner, bɔr ubinkpi Ipfu-Num iki imar uwu ipfu. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Niba ugũo idzeu umum iki igɔr ungo ugɛ, &lt;Awu ufang umbɔ abvui amar umbi.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Ugba ufɛu ra anangkɛ ukpɔ uku ubee. Ungo ugũo ititɔngkpɔ, bɔr ungo usi ihwɛngo anangkɛ ukpɔ uku udzek, ikɛi ungo usi ihwɛngo anangkɛ ukpɔ uku izĩ. Iwu rimi nggu unerwi Ipfu-Num iki imar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Unikodimu arhusu Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɛrɛ ha akorha aguse na awe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu umarhem uwuku ugɔng ru Uisrairha, bɔr ungo usi ihwɛngo abina akɛrɛ? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Umum indɛyiwa ungo idzidzɛrhe, umɛn irherha abinkɛ umɛn iki ihwɛng, ikɛi umɛn ĩdzaa umbi ideka abinkɛ umɛn iki inyã, bɔr utsɛku icɛrɛ umbi akpɛ̃mbi iyɛi idekayɛ umɛn iki isɔma umbi. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Uba umum irherhuwa umbi arherhe ra abinkɛ aka uwe ru upfung nu umbi asi iwembi ri imangmang, ude umbi akorha aguse na awe ru imangmang umum ĩba isɔma umbi abinkɛ aka awe ra afã? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Unera anasi ifũã ra afã. Ungwɛ̃-Ner ukpekũ unga aka adzek umɔ acipuwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Ru nyaku Umusa aka aberi ibvui nu ucici ra arhum, rimi hã ikɛi awu ufang umbɔ aberu Ungwɛ̃-Ner, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>agɛ uwuruwi aka awea ri imangmang ru unga ama akpo urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa.<verse eid="JHN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>&lt;&lt;Unum abemu upfunga akarhãrhã nggee unga adzowe unanyĩ Ungwɛ̃nga, agɛ ubɛn unera aka awea ri imangmang ru unga asi íkpea, bɔr unga awuri ikpo urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Unum asi idenuka Ungwɛ̃nga ru upfung agɛ unga atsu uvau ru upfung, bɔr agɛ upfung ukpo ififɔrh ru uboknga. <verse eid="JHN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Ubɛn uwuku uwe ru imangmang ru Ungwɛ̃ Unum, asi ítsumbɔ uvau ru unga, bɔr uwuruwi aka asi iwea ri imangmang ru unga, aka atsumbɔ uvau ru unga, ubinkutsu asi idzowuka imangmang ri itsok unanyĩ Ungwɛ̃ Unum. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Nu izharha arherhenga iwe ri iminɛ. Irhirhang itsĩwã ru upfung, bɔr anera abemu uzĩ anangmbɔ irhirhang, ubinkutsu itsermbɔ iwu iyiki ibewe. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Ubɛn uwuku utɔ̃itser iyiki ibewe akpɛ̃ irhirhang, asi íbanga ri irhirhang, utsur umbɔ anyãmbɔ itsernga. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Bɔr uwuku utɔ̃itser idzidzɛrhe aka isaka aba ra anang aka arhurhang ngge itsú umbɔ anyã ra awiya agɛ abinkɛ unga aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ ikikorhe awu Unum ayike unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ideka Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima <optbreak/> ru Uyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Akɛrɛ aka amaa, Uyesu nu angwɛ̃ imesanga adzek azĩmbɔ abĩ Uyahudiya, umɔ unga amaa inuma irhɛirhɛ nggu umbɔ, anu ikorhuwe ubɔtisima ra anera. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Uyohana ikɛi anu ikorhuwe ubɔtisima ru Uainon uku ukhapa nggu Usarhim, ubinkutsu amɛ̃ awu arhɛrhɛ umɔ. Anera ubɛn unum akɛyi ru unga umɔ azĩ isorhu ubɔtisima. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Akɛrɛ ha akorhuke kata, umbɔ adɔrha agbange Uyohana ru ugborzĩ. <verse eid="JHN 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Umɔ angwɛ̃ imesu Uyohana atsĩmbɔ uning nggu utsa Uyahuda uwɔɔ ra arherhi isorh iyor ru nyaka agbeyi abi Uyahuda. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Umbɔ azĩmbɔ ru Uyohana agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, utsa ha umbi aka awu nggu unga unum hã ru ugar ubang Azɛ̃ Urdun, uwu ha ungo uku udzowe ideka ri itsinga hã, unggawɔ nggɔɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ isorhuwe ubɔtisima. Anera kishoo azĩ ru unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Mɔcɛ Uyohana agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ ayɛisa ubin, Unum aba asi ídzowuka ukpɔ ra afã. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Umbi awu idekamum, umum ĩgɔr ugɛ, &lt;Asi iwea umum iwu Ukiristo, bɔr adena umum inggbaashia ĩba.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Utsak uwuku ufa unga apfunu utsɛrh uwuku ufa. Bɔr uwɛrhu utsak uwuku ufa uwuku uzĩ irhowa ipfuna hã aka isaka adzɛu igũ irhak utsak uwuku ufa, na aka isaka agɔm anggɔm ri ivangyɛ unga aka igũ irhak utsak uwuku ufa ha. Anggɔm hã awu akimum, atsuafɛr icɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Awu ufang unga awu ukugɔnga, bɔr awu ufang umum iwu uku ucia.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwuruwi aka adzeka afã aba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>&lt;&lt;Uwuruwi aka adzeka afã aba ananga anera kishoo. Uwuruwi aka adzeka abĩ awu uwu abĩ na arherhe ra abinkɛ aka awu ra abĩ. Uwuruwi aka adzeka afã aba ananga kishoo. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Unga arherhe ideka ubinkpi unga aka agũ na anyã, bɔr anera asi iyɛimbɔ idekanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Ubɛn unera aka ubemu idekanga atsu utsar adɛyiwe ugɛ Unum arherhi idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Uwu ha Unum aka adene arherhe irhɛm Unum, ubinkutsu adzowe Ipfu iyiriyɛ iki isi ímaangge. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Utɛ abemu Ungwɛ̃ na atsuke abina kishoo ru uboknga. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Ubɛn uwuku uwe ru imangmang ru Ungwɛ̃ awea ru urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa, bɔr ubɛn uwuku ukpɛ̃ɛ̃ Ungwɛ̃ asi ínyãã urhɛ, ubinkutsu avɔm Unum awu ni itsinga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu arherhe nggu utsɛrh Usamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Abi Ufarisi aka agũ ugɛ Uyesu ani akposha angwɛ̃ imesa ananga Uyohana na ani akorhuwe umbɔ ubɔtisima. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Bɔr asi iwea Uyesu aka isaka akorhuwe umbɔ ubɔtisima hã, awu angwɛ̃ imesanga aka isaka akorhuwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Ivangyɛ Uteijee aka agũ akɛrɛ, unga asoka ru Uyahudiya na abvui azĩã Ugarhirhi.<verse eid="JHN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Unga awuri itsĩ ru Usamariya atɔng. <verse eid="JHN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Nggee unga aba atsĩ ru uteu ukpɔɔ ru Usamariya umbɔ iki iyisa Usaikar, ukhapa ra abĩkɛ Uyakubu aka adzowe ungwɛ̃nga Uyusuf. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Uvãã amɛ̃ Uyakubu uwe ra anang hã. Azhe uzɛ̃rhã aka afɛr Uyesu, unga asei ra angwĩ uvãã amɛ̃ hã. Aka awu idzingga atenuma.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Utsɛrh Usamariya uwɔɔ aka aba ishɔyi amɛ̃, Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uma udzaango amɛ̃ umum ihwa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga aka azĩmbɔ ru utepa igoi ubingha. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus and Samaritan woman" file="LB00302b.TIF" size="col" loc="JHN 4.7" copy="Louise Bass" ref="4.7">Uyesu nggu utsɛrh Usamariya</figure><verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Utsɛrh Usamariya ha agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu utsa Uyahuda. Umum iwu utsɛrh Usamariya. Awu use utsu ungo urhusa umum amɛ̃ aka ahwa?&gt;&gt; Unga arhusa akɛrɛ ubinkutsu abi Uyahuda aka asi isaka agbopumbɔ nggu abi Usamariya.<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba ungo uhwɛngo izũwã Unum nu unerwi aka arhusa ungo amɛ̃ aka ahwa, ungo uwuri ifɛnungo unga, unga adzaa ungo amɛ̃ akika adzowe urhɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Utsɛrh ha agɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A uteiya, umum inyã ungo ushiɔ ru ubin ukpuku ushɔi nu uvãã amɛ̃ ukpi uwu ughorghotakpɔ. Ri inɛ̃ɛ̃ ungo iki ikpo amɛ̃ akika adzowe urhɛ ha? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Use ungo unango utɛmɛn Uyakubu, unga aka aneka uvãã amɛ̃ ru umɛn? Unga nibikanga ahwa amɛ̃ hã, ikɛi angwɛ̃nga, nu íjuɛnga aka ahwa umɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn uwuku uhwa amɛ̃ akɛrɛ awuri ibvui agũã ugɔ̃ amɛ̃ ikɛi. <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Bɔr ubɛn uwuku uhwa amɛ̃mum iki ĩdzowe unga asi íbvui agũã ugɔ̃ amɛ̃ ugbagbaa. Amɛ̃ hã umum iki idzowe unga awuri iwu akwiu amɛ̃ ru umbɔ aka idzowe urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Utsɛrh ha agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A uteiya, udzaa umum amɛ̃ hã utsur umum ibvui ĩgũmum ugɔ̃ amɛ̃ ikɛi ni isi íbvui ikɛyiwamum ishɔng amɛ̃ nggimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uzĩ uyisu utsakngo umbi aba nggimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ishimum ru utsak.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo urherhi idzidzɛrhe ungo uku ugɔr ugɛ, ungo ushiɔ ru utsak. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Ubinkutsu ungo uku uweɔ ra atsaka atɔ̃ɔ̃ nu unerwi umbi aka awu nggu unga icɛrɛ asi iwea utsakngo. Ungo urherhe ishaa idzidzɛrhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Utsɛrh ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;A uteiya, umum inyã ungo uwu uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Atokamɛn adzowe Unum igɔng ri igũ iyɛrɛ, bɔr umbi abi Uyahuda agɛ Urusharhima ukpɔ umɛ̃ɛ̃ awu ufang anera adzowe igɔng ru Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A utsɛrh ha, uwe ru imangmang ra abinkɛ umum iki irherhe. Ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ anera asi ídzowukumbɔ Utɛ igɔng ri igũ iyɛrɛ use ru Urusharhima. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Umbi abi Usamariya asi ihwɛngmbi ubinkpi umbi aka idzowe igɔng. Bɔr umɛn abi Uyahuda ihwɛngmɛn ubinkpi umɛn iki idzowe igɔng, ubinkutsu udĩ ififɔrh udzeka ra abi Uyahuda. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Bɔr ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ, iki ibangge, abika adzowe igɔng idzidzɛrhe aka idzowe Utɛ igɔng ri Ipfu nu idzidzɛrhe, ubinkutsu Utɛ abee ikpũ abi ha adzowe unga igɔng. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Unum awu ipfu, abika adzowe unga igɔng ikɛi awu ufang umbɔ adzowe igɔng ri Ipfu nu idzidzɛrhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Utsɛrh ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ihwɛng Uarhmasihu, awu unga umbɔ iki iyisa Ukiristo, nggawɔ abarɔ. Ivangyɛ unga aka iba, unga awuri idɛyiwanga umɛn abina kishoo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu adɛyiwe unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum uner arherhakɛ nggu ungo, iwu unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Angwɛ̃ imesa abvui aba ru Uyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Ivang hã niyɔ angwɛ̃ imesanga abvui aba adzeidzeu umbɔ aka anyã unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ arherhe nggu ukutsɛrh. Bɔr unera asi igɔra agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo ubee use,&gt;&gt; use arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu ungo urherha arherhe nggu unga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Mɔcɛ utsɛrh ha abɔruka idzum amɛ̃nga umɔ na atsĩã ru utepa na agɔr anera agɛ, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>&lt;&lt;Àka aba anyã unerwi aka adɛyiwa umum kishoo abinkɛ umum iki ikorhe! Awu unga awu Ukiristo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Umbɔ adzeku utepa aba ra anang Uyesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga ashɔ̃rhã unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, uma ugha ubingha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Bɔr unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwemum ru ubinkpi umum iki igha umbi aka asi ihwɛngmbi ukpɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Mɔcɛ angwɛ̃ imesanga arhusa adɔka agɛ, &lt;&lt;Use unera akũ ubingha akowe unga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Bɔr Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubinghamum ukpi, umum ikorhu ubin amɛn uwuku udena umum ĩba, ikɛi imashuwe itseryɛ unga aka adzaa umum. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Uba umbi aka isaka agɔr agɛ, &lt;Abɔr afɛ̃ɛ̃ anaa umbɔ atirhi igbɛr abin&gt;? Bɔr umum idɛyiwa umbi, aka agbisha arhi icanga. Iki ikɔ̃ngge, ni iki iwengge iyiki igbigbɛr. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Uner uwuku ugbɛr abin hã aka ikpoa itosanga, ikɛi unga ani ikɔng anera aka akpo urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa, ngge itsú uner uwuku udoi nu uner uwuku ugbugbɛr agɔm anggɔm urhɔnga. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Ake awu idzidzɛrhe, ake aka agɔr agɛ, &lt;Uwɔɔ adoi, nu uwɔɔ agbɛr.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Umum idena umbi igbɛr abinkɛ umbi aka asi itɔ̃mbi itser ake. Abɔɔ umbɔ atɛ̃wã itsera, umbi agbɛr ugarh ititɛ̃wãmbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Abi Usamariya awu arhɛrhɛ ru uteu ha umbɔ aka awe ru imangmang ru Uyesu ri itsi ideka utsɛrh ha aka agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga adɛyiwa umum kishoo abinkɛ umum iki ikorhe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Abi Usamariya aka aba ru unga, umbɔ ashɔ̃rhã unga asei nggu umbɔ, unga asei inuma ivaa. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Arherhanga atsu anera arhɛrhɛ awe ru imangmang.<verse eid="JHN 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Umbɔ agɔr utsɛrh ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn iwe ru imangmang ru Uyesu, ubinkutsu asi iwea ubinkpi ungo uku urherhe ukpekũ, bɔr icɛrɛ umɛn igũmɛn nibikamɛn ni ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ uwɛrɛ ha idzidzɛrhe unga awu Uwuku Ufɔrh upfunga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu akerhuwe ungwɛ̃ uner itser ijee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Inuma ivaa ha iki imaa unga asok azĩã Ugarhirhi. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Uyesu nibikanga adekuka ugɛ uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num aka isaka ashia ri imor ra abĩnga. <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka itsĩ Ugarhirhi, abi Ugarhirhi ayɛi unga aboka avaa, ubinkutsu umbɔ ikɛi azĩmbɔ Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng hã ru Urusharhima na anyãmbɔ kishoo abin Uyesu aka akorhe.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu abvui azĩã iyepu uteu Ukana ukpu Ugarhirhi, anangkɛ unga aka adzipa amɛ̃ ake awu amɛ̃ inebi. Utsa uner itser ijee nuwɔ uwuruwi ungwɛ̃nga aka aghonga unga ru Ukafanahum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Ivangyɛ utsa ha aka agũ ugɛ Uyesu aka adzeku Uyahudiya abvui abanga Ugarhirhi, unga azĩ ru unga ashɔ̃rhã unga ama aba akerhuwe ungwɛ̃nga, aka abɔr akpe.<verse eid="JHN 4:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi aba asi inyãmbi atsar nu abin idzeu, umbi asi íwembi ri imangmang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Uner itser ijee ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteiya, uba umɛn izĩmɛn utsur ungwɛ̃mum akpea.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo udɛ̃ɛ̃ uzĩɔ. Ungwɛ̃ngo awuri ibɛka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Utsa ha awea ri imangmang nu ubin Uyesu aka arherhe nggu unga, umɔ unga azĩã. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Ana awe ru utsĩndĩ ugãrhãnga agbanga unga, agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɛ̃ngo abɛka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Unga arhusa umbɔ ivangyɛ ungwɛ̃ hã aka atirhi igũ ugarha. Umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Imani iyor ha ineke unga arhɛkɛ ru ukara unying.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Utei ungwɛ̃ hã ayita, ivang hã niyɔ Uyesu agɔra unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɛ̃ngo awuri ibɛka.&gt;&gt; Nggee unga nu aner iyanga kishoo awe ru imangmang.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Akɛrɛ awu ubin idzeu ukpu uvaa Uyesu aka akorhe unga aka adzeku Uyahudiya azĩ Ugarhirhi.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Akerhuwe ru ukaukpi umbɔ <optbreak/> aki iyisa Ubetasda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Akɛrɛ aka amaa, Uyesu azĩã irhowa abi Uyahuda ru Urusharhima. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Ru Urusharhima ukau amɛ̃ nukpɔ umbɔ iki iyisa ri idũ abi Uyahuda agɛ Ubetasda. Ukpɔ ukhapa ru angwĩ ufɔm, anangkɛ ídɔi iki itsĩ. Aka akũ atarh atang nggaa atsurha atɔ̃ɔ̃ adzipu ukau ha. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Awu ra atsurha ha abi irhãrhã nu abi ibvuta, nu akatarhu nu abi ishayi iyor arhɛrhɛ aka isaka anu umɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abvur akɔɔ aki itsɛng abok aki isha agɔrke ikɛi ugɛ, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ubinkutsu iva-ivanga ipfu itser-Num iki isaki icipuwa ru ukau amɛ̃ hã iba idzipa ukpɔ. Kishoo uwuruwi aka agbaashia atsĩã ra amɛ̃ hã ivangyɛ ake aka idzipa amaa, unga awuri ikikerhunga irhãrhĩ iyornga kishoo.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Uner uwɔɔ aka amaa imɛka isɔka itaar ni imɛka utɔrɔk asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ azɛ̃rhũnga. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Uyesu aka anyã ininunga, ikɛi ahwɛnga utsa ha aka adãrhũnga nggu irhãrhã hã, unga arhusu uner irhãrhã hã agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo ubeengo ikikerhe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Uner irhãrhã hã agɛ, &lt;&lt;A uteiya, umum ishimum ru unera aka iyika umum itsĩ ru amɛ̃ ivangyɛ ake aka idzipa. Umum ĩba itita ibee itsitsĩwã, uwɔɔ agbaangashia ru umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Usisok, unyangu ufarngo, ukũ uzɛ̃rhã!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Kanying, uner ha akerhunga. Anyangu ufarnga atirhunga uzɛ̃rhã.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Akɛrɛ ha akorhe ru unum ukpuku uwosha. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Nggee anggbaashi abi Uyahuda agɔr utsa ha aka akerhe agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu unum ukpuku uwosha. Ikpem ikɛnngge ungo itsã ufar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Bɔr utsa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unerwi aka akerhuwa umum agɔr umum agɛ, &lt;Unyangu ufarngo uso uzɛ̃rhã.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Nggee umbɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ungamɔ uner ha aka agɔr ungo ugɛ unyanga umgbɔ uso uzɛ̃rhã?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Utsa ha aka akerhe asi ihwɛngnga awu ungamɔ akerhuwe unga, ubinkutsu Uyesu aka azɛ̃rhã atsĩã ra anera arhɛrhɛ umɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Ivanga ukunjiir iki itɔng Uyesu akpo unga ri Iya-Num na agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unyã ungo uku ukerhungo! Uneke arhim utsur ubin uku unangkpɔ akɛrɛ ha ukpokpɔ ungo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Utsa ha azĩ adɛyiwe anggbaashi abi Uyahuda agɛ awu Uyesu unga akerhuwe unga.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Urhɛ ru ubok Ungwɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Ngge itsu anggbaashi abi Uyahuda adzowe uver ru Uyesu, ubinkutsu itser iyiki ikikerhe ha unga aki itɔ̃ ru unum ukpuku uwosha. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utɛmum anu itser utsɛku irherɛ, umum rimi hã ini ititɔ̃.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Arherha akɛrɛ atsu anggbaashi abi Uyahuda abee ifɛre Uyesu. Agɔr agɛ unga asi izharhuka ikpem unum ukpuku uwosha ukpekũ, bɔr unga agɔr agɛ Unum awu Utɛnga na anu inyãngu itsinga uku kpengkpeng nggu Unum.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, Ungwɛ̃ asi íkorhunga ifɛrhɛ nibikanga, unga akpurha akorhu ubinkpi unga aka anyã Utɛnga aki ikorhe, ubinkutsu ubinkpi Utei iki ikorhe awu ukpɔ Ungwɛ̃ hã awuri ikorhe. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Ubinkutsu Utɛ abemu Ungwɛ̃ na adɛyiwe unga kishoo abinkɛ unga aka isaka akorhe. Ĩĩ, umbɔ awuri idɛyiwe unga abinkɛ aka anangke akɛrɛ ha nu umbi awuri idzedzeu. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Ru nyaku Utɛ iki isoyiwe abika akpukpe na adzowe umbɔ urhɛ, rimi Ungwɛ̃ hã awuri idzowe urhɛ ru kishoo abirabɛ unga aka abee idzidzowe. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Rimi hã, Utɛ asi ítsuka uvau ru unera, bɔr adzowe ijee itsu uvau ru Ungwɛ̃nga, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>ngge itsú umbɔ kishoo adzowe igɔng ru Ungwɛ̃ ru nyaka umbɔ iki idzowe igɔng ru Utɛ. Uwuruwi aka asi idzowuka igɔng ru Ungwɛ̃, asi idzowuka igɔng ru Utɛ uwuku udene unga.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>&lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, uwuku ugũ arherhamum na adzowuka imangmang ru uwuku udena umum ĩba, awea ru urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa na asi ítsumbɔ unga uvau. Unga aka agar akpe azĩã urhɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ ni iki ibangge abika akpe awuri igũmbɔ urhɛm Ungwɛ̃ Unum nu abika agũ hã awuri ibɛkmbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Ru nyaku Utɛ aka awe ru urhɛ ri itsikamnga, rimi hã unga aka adzowe Ungwɛ̃nga ijee iyiki idzowe urhɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Utɛ ikɛi adzowuka unga ijee iyiki ivarha arherhe, ubinkutsu unga awu Ungwɛ̃-Ner.<verse eid="JHN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>&lt;&lt;Niba agũmbi idzeu akɛrɛ ha, ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ kishoo abika awe ra adzak awuri igũmbɔ urhɛmnga <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>na adzeka. Abika akorhe iyiki ize awuri isok ra akpe abɛk, bɔr abika akorhe iyiki ibewe awuri isok akpo uvau itsitsĩme. <verse eid="JHN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>Umum nibikami isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ ikorhumum ubin. Umum itsu uvau ubinkpi umum iki igũ ukpekũ. Itsu uvaumum iwu iyiki irhika, ubinkutsu isi idɔsumum ubinkpi amɛnmum aki ibee bɔr aki uwuku udena umum.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ideka ri itsi Uyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>&lt;&lt;Umum ĩba idzowe ideka itsimum, idekamum isi iwengge idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Bɔr uner uwɔ aba adzowe ideka ri itsimum, umum ihwɛng ideka ha ri itsimum iwe idzidzɛrhe.<verse eid="JHN 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>&lt;&lt;Adzaanga umbi ideka idzidzɛrhe ri ivangyɛ umbi adene anera azĩ ru Uyohana. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Asi iwea ugɛ umum itsorhi itsimum ri ideku unera, bɔr umum irherhe rimi ngge ítsu umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ akpo ififɔrh. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Uyohana awu ru nyaki irhirhang iki igar ni irhang, umbi atsũmbi igũibɛn irhirhangnga ri ivanga ukunjiir.<verse eid="JHN 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr umum iwemum ri idekayɛ iki inangngge ideka Uyohana. Ubinkutsu itseryɛ Utɛmum aka adzaa umum imasha, iyiriyɛ umum iki inũ itɔ̃ icɛrɛ, ngge idekuwe ugɛ awu Utɛ unga adena umum. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Utɛ uwuku udena umum adzowuka ideka ri itsimum. Umbi anasi anyãmbi unga use agũmbi urhɛmnga <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>nu arherhanga asi iseike ru umbi, ubinkutsu umbi asi iwembi ri imangmang ru uwu ha unga aka adene. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Umbi atsu amɛnmbi ivarhi itsɛng Arherhu-Num, ubinkutsu umbi akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ umbi awuri ikpikpombi urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa ru ngge. Itsɛng Arherhu-Num hã ngge idzowe ideka ri itsimum. <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Bɔr umbi akpɛ̃mbi iba ru umum aba akpo urhɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>&lt;&lt;Umum isi iyɛimum ikpikpoi ra anera. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Bɔr umum ihwɛng umbi. Umum ihwɛng ugɛ umbi asi ibemumbi Unum ra amɛnmbi. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Umum iba ri itsok Utɛmum, umbi asi iyɛimbi umum, bɔr uwɔɔ aba, aba ri itsok ukamnga, umbi awuri iyɛimbi unga. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Umbi awuri ikorha aguse na awe ru imangmang uba umbi ayɛi ukpoi ra adɔkambi, bɔr umbi asi ibeembi iyɛi ikpikpoi iki idzeku Unum unying ukpekũ?<verse eid="JHN 5:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr aka niba akaimbi ifɛrhkɔ ugɛ umum iwuri ihwitumum umbi ru Utɛ. Uwuku uhwita umbi awu Umusa, uwuruwi umbi aka afosa. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Agɛ umbi awembi ri imangmang ru Umusa, umbi awuri iwembi ri imangmang ru umum, ubinkutsu unga atsɛng itsɛng ri itsimum. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Bɔr umbi aba ashimbi ri imangmang ra abinkɛ Umusa aka atsɛng, umbi akorha aguse na awe ru imangmang ra abinkɛ umum iki irherhe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu afuka anera anaka agɔnga atɔ̃ɔ̃</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Umat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Umar 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Irh 9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Akɛrɛ aka amaa Uyesu agar Ukau ukpu Ugarhirhi, ukpɔ uku uwe ukau ukugɔng ukpu Utibariya. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Nggaa ikikɔng anera idɔsa unga, ubinkutsu umbɔ aka anyã atsar abin idzeukɛ unga aka akorhuwe abi irhãrhã. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu afũã ri ifɛn igũ aseisa umɔ nggu angwɛ̃ imesanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng iyi abi Uyahuda iki iyongge.<verse eid="JHN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Ivangyɛ Uyesu aka abera asunga anyã anera arhɛrhɛ aka aba ru unga, unga agɔr Ufirhibu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn igoi uborodi ri inɛ̃ɛ̃ ukpɔ umɛ̃ɛ̃ aner abɛrɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Unga arhusa rimi avira unga, ubinkutsu unga aka ahwɛnga ra amɛnnga ubinkpi unga aka ikorhe.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Ufirhibu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uborodi ukpu imang itser afɛ̃ɛ̃ utɔrɔk usi ímɛ̃kpɔ ubɛn unera akpo atsɔr idiki unying!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Uwɔɔ ra angwɛ̃ imesanga hã agburh Uandarawu, ungwɛ̃mbɔ Usiman Ubitru, arherhe agɛ, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>&lt;&lt;Ungwɛ̃ uwɔɔ uwi nggimi nggu ípo uborodi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akũ akɔ̃ ubin ukpɔɔ umbɔ iki iyisa ubarhe akorhu uborodi ukpirɛ, ikpũ uborodi ha uwu ubingha atsũwã.</char></note> itɔ̃ɔ̃ nu abɛrh avaa. Bɔr iwuri imɛ̃ use nggu arhɛrha aner abɛrɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka agɔr anera asei isei.&gt;&gt; Ra anang hã ubĩĩ uwu urhɛrhɛ umɔ, anera kishoo aseisa abĩ. Akatsak atsĩmbɔ anaka agɔnga atɔ̃ɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu anyangu ípo uborodi ha, unga aka atar uwɛɛ ru Unum, na agashuwe anera aka asei ubinkpi uku imɛ̃ ru umbɔ. Rimi hã unga aka akorhe nggu abɛrh ha.<verse eid="JHN 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Ivang umbɔ aka atãi ashuur, unga agɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka arhɔsa awushunga aka abɔr utsur ubin ugbakpɔ abĩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Ri ípo uborodi itɔ̃ɔ̃ hã, anera aka atãi na abɔre, angwɛ̃ imesanga arhɔsa awushu uborodi na atɔke azĩnga usɔka na avaa.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Ivang anera aka anyã utsar ubin idzeu Uyesu aka akorhe, umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Idzidzɛrhe, unga awu uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num hã Unum aka abemuwa umɛn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Uyesu aka ahwɛnga agɛ anera abee atsime unga iyɛrhe ri inggang, unga abvui afũã ni igũa ikiyikanga.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu azɛ̃rhã nu amɛ̃</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Umat 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Umar 6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Urhɛɛ uku uwe, angwɛ̃ imesanga acipa azĩmbɔ ru ukau ha, <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>anangkɛ umbɔ aka atsĩ ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ na agar ukau ha azĩmbɔ Ukafanahum. Ri ivang hã ananga aka atirhi iwu uzĩ, nu Uyesu anasi ibanga ru umbɔ kata. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Nggaa ugba ukerketakpɔ ubvun amɛ̃ ru ukau ha. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Umbɔ aka azĩmbɔ akirhomita atɔ̃ɔ̃ use utɔ̃ĩ, umbɔ anyã Uyesu azɛ̃rhã nú amɛ̃ aba ayoku ukhukhɔɔ ha. Iwei ifɛr umbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Bɔr unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu umum. Niba agũmbi iwei.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ ayɛi unga ru ukhukhɔɔ ha nggu anggɔm. Kanying ukhukhɔɔ ha utsĩ anangkɛ umbɔ aka izĩ.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Ukpe unum uvaa abika asei ugar ukau ukugɔng hã ahwɛngmbɔ ugɛ awu ukhukhɔɔ unying uku uzĩ ugar ha. Ikɛi ahwɛngmbɔ ugɛ Uyesu ashia ru ukhukhɔɔ ha nggu angwɛ̃ imesanga. Awu angwɛ̃ imesa ha ukpekũ azĩ. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Bɔr akhukhɔɔ akɔɔ aka adzeku Utibariya adɛ̃ɛ̃ akhapa ra anang aner ha aka atãi uborodi ukpu Uteijee aka atar uwɛɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Ivang anera aka anyã agɛ Uyesu nu angwɛ̃ imesanga ashimbɔ ra anang hã, umbɔ atsĩ akhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ na azĩmbɔ Ukafanahum anu ibee Uyesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu awu uborodi ukpuku <optbreak/> udzowe urhɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka anyã unga ugar ukau ha, umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, ukang ungo uku uba nggimi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, ubinkutsu umbi abeea umum, asi iwea atsar abin idzeu umum iki ikorhe, bɔr awu uborodi ukpɔ umbi aka atãi ashur. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Niba atɔ̃mbi itser ri ibee abin igha akika adak, bɔr aka atɔ̃ itser abinghakɛ aka azĩ utsĩ urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa, akirakɛ Ungwɛ̃-Ner aka awuri idzaa umbi. Awu ru unga Unum Utɛ aka angwɛ̃ utsar ijeenga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ufang umɛn ikorhu use itɔ̃ itser Unum aka abee?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Itser Unum aka abee nggayɛ, uwe ri imangmang ru uwuruwi unga aka adene.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Nggee umbɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwuri ikorhe utsar ubin idzeu ukusong umɛn iki inyã ni iwe ru imangmang ru ungo? Ungo uwuri ukorhu use? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Atoka-atokamɛn agha umanna ra arhum, ru nyaka umbɔ aka atsɛng ra Arherhu-Num agɛ, &lt;Unga adzowe uborodi uku udzeka afã umbɔ atãi.&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Idzi 16.4</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:15">Uneh 9.15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Amb 78.24</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 78:25">25</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, asi iwea Umusa unga adzaa umbi uborodi ha ra afã, awu Utɛmum unga adzaa umbi uborodi ukpu idzidzɛrhe uku udzeka afã. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Uborodi Unum hã, uwu unga aka acipuwa ra afã na adzowe urhɛ ru upfung.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteiya, utirhi icɛrɛ udzisa umɛn uborodi ha ubɛn unuma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu adɛyiwe umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwu uborodi ha ukpuku udzowe urhɛ. Uwuruwi aka aba ru umum asi ígũa imerh, nu uwuruwi aka awe ru imangmang ru umum asi ígũa ugɔ̃ ugbagbaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Bɔr ru nyaka umum iki idɛyiwa umbi, umbi aka anyãmbi umum nu utsɛku icɛrɛ umbi anasi iwembi ri imangmang. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Kishoo uwuruwi Utɛ aka adzaa umum awuri iba ru umum, nu ubɛn uwuku uba ru umum ikɛi umum isi íwayikũ unga. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Umum ĩdzek ra afã isi ĩbamum ikorhu ubin amɛnmum iki ibee, bɔr ikorhu ubin uwuku udena umum. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Amɛn uwuku udena umum akɛ, agɛ, umum niba igwirhukũ unying ru kishoo abirabɛ unga aka adzaa umum, bɔr umum isoyiwe umbɔ ru unum ukpuku umasha. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Ubin Utɛmum ukpi aka abee agɛ, kishoo uwuku urhi Ungwɛ̃ na awea ri imangmang ru unga awea ru urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa. Mɔcɛ umum iwuri isoyikũ unga ru unum ukpuku umasha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Akɛrɛ ha atsu abi Uyahuda adɛ̃ɛ̃mbɔ ibvibvun ri itsi Uyesu ubinkutsu, unga aka agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwu uborodi ukpuku udzeka afã ucipuwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Abi Uyahuda agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea Uyesu nuwi ungwɛ̃ Uyusuf, uwuruwi umɛn iki ihwɛng utɛnga nu uyanga? Ude awu use utsu icɛrɛ unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;Umum idzeka afã icipuwa&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka neke ibvibvun. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Unera asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ abanga ru umum utsɛku Utɛ uwuku udena umum iki idarha unga ĩba, nu umum iwuri isoyikũ uner ha ru unum ukpuku umasha. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Atsɛng ra abvur abika asɔm Arherhu-Num agɛ, &lt;Kishoo awu Unum unga imesuwe umbɔ.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Uish 54.13</ref></char>.</note> Ubɛn unera uwuku ukpeto na amesa ru Utɛ awuri iba ru umum. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Unera anasi inyã Utɛ ha akpurha awu uwuku udzeku Unum. Unga ukpekũ unga aka anyã Utɛ ha. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, ubɛn unera aka awe ru imangmang awea ru urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Umum iwu uborodi ukpuku udzowe urhɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Atoka-atokambi agha umanna ra arhum, bɔr rimi hã akpembɔ kishoo. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Bɔr aka anyã uborodi ha ukpi uku udzeka afã ucipuwa. Ubɛn unera aka itãi asi íkpea. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Umum iwu uborodi ukpu urhɛ uku udzeka afã ucipuwa. Ubɛn uwuku utãi uborodi ha awuri ibɛka ugbagbaa. Uborodi ha uwu ijuɛ iyormum, iyiriyɛ umum iki iwuri ĩdzowe ngge itsú upfunga uma ubɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Mɔcɛ abi Uyahuda atsĩmbɔ uning akarhãrhã ru ubinkpi Uyesu aka arherhe na agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner uwurɛ awuri ikorha aguse na adzaa ijuɛ iyornga umɛn itãi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, umbi aba asi itãimbi ijuɛ iyor Ungwɛ̃-Ner na ahwambi adzirhnga, urhɛ ushimgbɔ ru umbi. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Ubɛn uwuku utãi ijuɛ iyormum na ahwa adzirhmum awea ru urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa. Umum ikɛi iwuri isoyikũ unga ru unum ukpuku umasha. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Ijuɛ iyormum iwu uborodi ukpu idzidzɛrhe, nu adzirhmum ikɛi awu ubin uku uhwuhwa ukpu idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Ubɛn uwuku utãi ijuɛ iyormum, na ahwa adzirhmum, abɛk ru umum, umum igamum ibɛk ru unga. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Ru nyaku Utɛ uwu urhɛ aka adena umum, na awu ru unga umum iki ibɛk, rimi uwuku unyanga umum iwu ubinghanga, awuri ibɛka ru umum. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Umum iwu uborodi ha uku udzeka afã. Atoka-atokambi agha umanna nu umbɔ akpembɔ, bɔr unera aka atãi ru uborodi ukpirɛ awuri ibɛka ugbagbaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Uyesu arherha arherhe akɛrɛ kishoo ri ivangyɛ unga aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ imesuwe anera ru ubã ifɛn-Num ru Ukafanahum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irhɛm urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Igũ rimi hã, angwɛ̃ imesanga arhɛrhɛ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Imesa iyɛrɛ ighong. Ungaa adɛ̃ɛ̃ ayɛi ngge?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Uyesu aka ahwɛnga agɛ angwɛ̃ imesanga adɛ̃ɛ̃ ibvibvun ri imesa ha. Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Imesa ha itsu amɛnmbi aghong? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Ude, amɛnmbi awu aguse umbi aba anyã Ungwɛ̃-Ner afũ azĩã anangkɛ unga aka adzek? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Ipfu-Num ngge idzowe urhɛ. Iyor ishingge ri ijee ubin. Irhɛmyɛ umum iki isɔma umbi idzeku Ipfu ha iyiki idzowe urhɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Bɔr abimbi abɔɔ ashimbɔ ri imangmang.&gt;&gt; Uyesu ahwɛnga utirhi ri inggbaashia abika asheri imangmang, nu uwuruwi aka igha-daknga. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngge itsu unera asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ imɛ̃ɛ̃ iba ru umum, Utɛ aba asi ibemuka unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Udzur ri ivang iyɛrɛ arhɛrhɛ angwɛ̃ imesanga aka adɔsa unga abvui anekukumbɔ idɔsa unga.<verse eid="JHN 6:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Uyesu arhusa angwɛ̃ imesanga usɔkdũmɛn hã agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi abee ibvui azĩ hã ikɛi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Usiman Ubitru agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, ru ungaa umɛn iki izĩ? Awu ungo uwe ri irhɛm urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Umɛn iwemɛn ri imangmang nu umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ ungo uwu Usarkasar uwu Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea umum isɛng umbi kishoo usɔkdũmɛn? Bɔr unying ru umbi awu undenggũ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Arherhe akɛrɛ ru Uyahuda ungwɛ̃ Usiman Uiskariyoti, unying ru umbɔ usɔkdũmɛn hã, uwuruwi aka igha-daknga.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu azĩ Irhowa Atsurha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Akɛrɛ aka amaa, Uyesu azɛ̃rhã atsĩrhã amaa Ugarhirhi. Bɔr unga asi ibeenga itsĩ ru Uyahudiya, ubinkutsu anggbaashi abi Uyahuda abika awu nggɔɔ ha abee ifɛre unga. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Ivangyɛ Irhowa Atsurha abi Uyahuda iki iyo, <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>angwɛ̃mbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Imɛ̃ngge ungo uzĩ Uyahudiya, ngge itsú angwɛ̃ imesango anyã abin idzeukɛ ungo iki ikorhe. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Uwuku ubee anera ahwɛng unga akarhãrhã asi íwɔka ubinkpi unga iki ikorhe. Ungo uku ukorha abina akɛrɛ, udɛyiwe itsingo ru upfunga uhwɛng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Uko angwɛ̃mbɔ ashimbɔ ri imangmang ru unga.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Nggee Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ivanga inasi iwengge ru umum kata, bɔr ru umbi ubɛn ivang iwengge. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Umbi, upfunga usi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ ukpɛ̃kpɔ umbi, bɔr ukpɛ̃kpɔ umum ubinkutsu umum idekuwe ugɛ abinkɛ ukpɔ iki ikorhe awu aka abewe. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Umbi aka azĩ irhowa ha. Umum isi ízĩmum irhowa ha, ubinkutsu ivangmum inasi ibangge kata.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Unga aka amaa irherha akɛrɛ ha, mɔcɛ unga aseisa ru Ugarhirhi.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Bɔr ivang angwɛ̃mbɔ aka azĩmbɔ irhowa ha, unga azĩã ikɛi. Unga asi izĩã ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ bɔr ri iwɔk. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Anggbaashi abi Uyahuda anu ibeea unga ra anang irhowa ha, arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner ha awerɛ unga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Ikikɔnga aner ha ini ibvun urherhe nggu adɔka ri itsinga. Abɔɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu uner uwuku uze.&gt;&gt; Abɔɔ ikɛi agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ, anu irhɛm anera.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Bɔr unera asi irherhunga arherhe Uyesu ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ ubinkutsu, anu igũ iwei anggbaashi abi Uyahuda.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu amesuwe ru irhowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka agha uteng ivang irhowa ha, Uyesu atsĩ ri Iya-Num atirhunga imesuwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Anggbaashi abi Uyahuda adzeidzeu arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsak uwurɛ akorha aguse na ahwɛng rimi? Nggawi anasi itsĩa imesa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Imesamum isi iwengge iyimum. Idzeka ru Unum uwuku udena umum ĩba. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Ubɛn unera aka asɛng ikorhu ubinkpi Unum aka abema, awuri ihwɛngnga use imesamum idzeku Unum, use iwu iyimum. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Uwuruwi aka anu imesuwe abin ukamnga, anu ibeewe itsinga ikpikpoi. Bɔr uwuku ubeewe ikpikpoi ru uwuku udene unga awu uner idzidzɛrhe. Ashia ri igbɛrangwĩ ri itsinga. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Asi iwea Umusa adzaa umbi Íkpem? Bɔr umbi asi ikpɔmmbi Íkpem hã. Awu use utsu umbi abee ifɛre umum?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Anera agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwe ru ipfu iyiki ibewe ri itsingo! Ungamɔ abee ifɛre ungo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ikorhe ubin idzeu unying ukpekũ nu umbi kishoo adzeidzeu. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Umusa atsu umbi isorhu usorhe, ngge itsu umbi aka isaka asorhe awɛkacimbi usorhe ru unum ukpuku uwosha. Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, awu atoka-atokambi atirha akɛrɛ ha, asi iwea Umusa. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Umbi aba asorhukumbi awɛkaci ru unum ukpuku uwosha ri idɔsi Íkpem Umusa, awu use utsu umbi agũ avɔm nggu umum ri ikerhuwe undzumu unera ru unum ukpuku uwosha? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Àka niba azharhukumbi arherhe ra abinkɛ umbi iki inyã ra asu, bɔr àka azharha arherhunga uku urhirhiki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu unga awu Ukiristo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Aner Urusharhima abɔɔ aka awe umɔ arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea utsa ha nuwi umbɔ aka abee ififɛr ha? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Unga uwi nggimi, adɛ̃ɛ̃ arherhe ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ bɔr umbɔ asi idzipumbɔ urhɛm nggu unga. Use abi ijee aka abemumbɔ agɛ awu unga awu Ukiristo? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Bɔr umɛn ihwɛngmɛn anangkɛ utsak uwurɛ aka adzek. Ivang Ukiristo aka iwuri iba, unera asi íhwɛnga anangkɛ unga aka idzek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Uyesu ana adɛ̃ɛ̃ imesuwe anera ru ufɔm Iya-Num hã, unga atsarhi irhaknga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ, umbi ahwɛngmbi umum na ahwɛngmbi anangkɛ umum iki idzek. Bɔr umum isi iwemum nggimi nibikami. Unga hã uwuku udena umum awu idzidzɛrhe bɔr umbi asi ihwɛngmbi unga. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Bɔr umum ihwɛng unga, ubinkutsu umum indzeku unga, ikɛi unga adena umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ abee idzur unga, bɔr unera asi ibangunga ubok ru unga, ubinkutsu ivangnga inasi ibangge. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Bɔr anera arhɛrhɛ ri ikikɔnga awe ru imangmang ru unga na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ivangyɛ Ukiristo aka iba, awuri ikorha atsar abin idzeu akɔɔ anangmbɔ aki uner uwɛrɛ ha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Abi Ufarisi agũ anera anu ibvun arherha ha ri Iya-Num nggu adɔkambɔ ri itsinga. Mɔcɛ ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num nu abi Ufarisi adene abika adzɛu Iya-Num umbɔ adzure unga.<verse eid="JHN 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ivangyɛ umum iki iwe nggu umbi ibɔr ukunjiir, mɔcɛ umum iwuri ibvui izĩ ru uwuruwi aka adena umum. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Umbi awuri ibeembi umum, bɔr umbi asi íkpombi umum. Anangkɛ umum iki iwe ikɛi umbi asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ abambi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Anggbaashi abi Uyahuda ha arherhe nggu adɔkambɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsak uwurɛ awuri izĩnɛnga umɛn iki isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ ikpomɛn unga? Use unga awuri izĩ ra anangkɛ abimɛn aka asaka asei nggu abi Uherhini na amesuwe abi Uherhini hã? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Akaifɛrhkɔ use ra amɛnnga, ivangyɛ unga aka agɔr agɛ, &lt;Umbi awuri ibeembi umum, bɔr umbi asi íkpombi umum,&gt; na agɔr agɛ, &lt;Anangkɛ umum iki iwe umbi asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ abambi&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Ru unum ukpuku umashu irhowa ha uku uwe nggaa unum hã, Uyesu adɛ̃ɛ̃ na atsarhi irhaknga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba unera agũã ugɔ̃, unga aba ru umum aba ahwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Ubɛn unera aka awea ri imangmang ru umum, ru nyaki itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr igɛ, &lt;Azɛ̃ amɛ̃ akika adzowe urhɛ awuri idzɛ̃rhã adzek ra amɛnnga.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Uyesu arherha akɛrɛ ri itsi Ipfu-Num, iyiriyɛ abika awe ru imangmang ru unga aka iwuri iyɛi. Ri ivang hã anasi idzowukumbɔ Ipfu-Num ha, ubinkutsu Uyesu ana ashia ri ikpikpoi kata.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka agũ irhɛmnga, abɔɔ ra anera agɛ, &lt;&lt;Idzidzɛrhe uwɛrɛ ha awu uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num hã Umusa aka arherhe ugɛ ibanga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Abɔɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga awu Ukiristo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Bɔr abɔɔ arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Akorha aguse ru Ukiristo adzeku Ugarhirhi? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Asi iwea itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ Ukiristo awuri idzeku unang Udauda, nu ru Ubaitarhami, uteukpi Udauda aka asei?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Ngge igigau itsĩngge ra anera ri itsinga. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Abɔɔ abee idzur unga, bɔr unera asi ibangunga ubok ru unga.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isheri imangmang anggbaashi <optbreak/> abi Uyahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Adogerhi Iya-Num aka abvui azĩ ra ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num nu abi Ufarisi arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbi asi ikũ unga abambi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Adogerhi ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera anasi irherhunga arherhe ru nyaku utsak uwurɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Abi Ufarisi arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga aka arhɛm nggu umbi ikɛi? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Use umbi anyãmbi unera ra anggbaashi abi Uyahuda use abi Ufarisi aka awe ru imangmang ru unga? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Ĩ'ĩ! Ikikɔng iyɛrɛ ha iki isi ihwɛngngge ubin ri Íkpem Umusa, awu ikponum ru umbɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Unikodimu, aka azĩã ru Uyesu, unga aka awu unying ra abi Ufarisi ha, arhusa umbɔ agɛ, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>&lt;&lt;Ri Íkpem, umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ itsumɛn uvau ru utsa ha umɛn iki inasi igũmɛn ra angwĩnga ni ihwɛng ubinkpi unga aka anu ikorhe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu uner Ugarhirhi ikɛi? Uvarhe ungo unyãɔ ugɛ, uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num ashia aka idzeku Ugarhirhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/></para>
  <para style="s2">[Abvur itsɛng abok akɔɔ aki isha ashike ru ubvur Uyoh 7.53—8.11]</para>
  <para style="s1">Ukutsɛrh umbɔ aka adzur ri itoma-dak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Mɔcɛ ikikɔnga isitungge nu ubɛn unera azĩã ri iyanga.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Bɔr Uyesu azĩã ri Igũ Acucii Uzaitun. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Ri igɔ̃kpeka ikɛi unga abvui atsĩã ru ufɔm Iya-Num. Kishoo anera aba akɔng adziira unga, nu unga asei na amesuwe umbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Abika amesuwe Ikpem nu abi Ufarisi akũ utsɛrh uwɔɔ umbɔ aka adzur unga ri itoma-dak. Atsu unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu ukpui ha. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Umbɔ agɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, utsɛrh uwurɛ adzur unga ri itoma-dak. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Ri Íkpem Umusa atsu umɛn ikũ atarh itang ikpũ akatsɛrh abɛrɛ ha ifɛre. Bɔr ungo ugɔr uguse?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Arhusa akɛrɛ ani ideya unga, na akpo ubinkpi umbɔ aka itsu arherhanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:6">Bɔr Uyesu agbapfu na akũ itoknga atsɛng itsɛng nú abĩ. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka ani irhusa unga, unga abera agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera aka ashia ra arhim ru umbi, unga atirha atang utarh ru utsɛrh ha.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Ikɛi unga abvui agbapfu na atsɛng itsɛng nú abĩ.<verse eid="JHN 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Umbɔ aka agũ rimi, umbɔ atirha asoyimbɔ ra anang hã unying anying. Umbɔ atirhi ru uwuku ukũmbɔ utsɛku umbɔ aneke Uyesu iki iyikanga nggu utsɛrh ha. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Uyesu abera adɛ̃ɛ̃ na arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A utsɛrh ha, umbɔ awerɛmbɔ? Unera asi itsuka ungo ufai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Utsɛrh ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;A uteiya, unera ashia.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ikɛi isi ítsukamum ungo ufai. Uzĩɔ̃, bɔr niba ubvui utsĩɔ̃ ra arhim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu unga awu irhirhang upfung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Uyesu abvui arherha arherhe nggu anera agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwu irhirhang upfung. Umbi aba adɔsumbi umum, umbi asi izɛ̃rhũmbi ru uzĩ, bɔr umbi awuri ikpombi irhirhang urhɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Abi Ufarisi agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uni idzowe ideka itsingo, nggee idekango isi iwengge idzidzɛrhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uko umum ĩba ĩdzowe itsimum ideka, idekamum iwu idzidzɛrhe, ubinkutsu umum ihwɛng anangkɛ umum iki ĩdzek, nu ikɛi anangkɛ umum iki izĩ. Bɔr umbi asi ihwɛngmbi anangkɛ umum iki ĩdzek, use anangkɛ umum iki izĩ. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Umbi atsu uvau ikpũ iyi anera. Umum isi itsukũ uvau ru unera. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Bɔr umum iba izharha arherhe, izharha arherhamum iwu idzidzɛrhe, ubinkutsu asi iwea umum ikiyikami izharha arherhunga, bɔr umum nu Utɛmum aka adena umum ikorhu urhɔnga. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Ri Íkpemmbi umbɔ atsɛng agɛ ideka inera ivaa iwe idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Umum ĩdzowe ideka ri itsimum, nu Utɛ uwuku udena umum unga awu uner uwu uvaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utɛngo hã awerɛ unga?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi asi ihwɛngmbi umum use Utɛmum. Umbi aba ahwɛngmbi umum, umbi awuri ihwɛngmbi Utɛmum ikɛi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Unga arherhe irhɛm iyɛrɛ ri ivangyɛ unga aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ imesa akhapa ra anangkɛ umbɔ aka angwɛ̃we uhwɛk izũwã ri Iya-Num. Bɔr unera asi idzura unga, ubinkutsu ivanga inasi iwengge kata.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anangkɛ umum iki izĩ <optbreak/> umbi asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ abambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Ikɛi Uyesu abvui adɛyiwe anera agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwuri izĩmum, nu umbi awuri ibeembi umum nu umbi awuri ikpe ra arhimmbi. Anangkɛ umum iki izĩ, umbi asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ abambi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Akɛrɛ ha atsu anggbaashi abi Uyahuda agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awuri ifɛre itsinga? Unga aka agɔr agɛ, &lt;Anangkɛ umum iki izĩ, umbi asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ abambi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Bɔr unga akpurha adɛ̃ɛ̃ igɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi awu anɔnɔr, umum idzeka afafã. Umbi awu abi upfung ukpirɛ, bɔr umum isi iwemum uwu upfung ukpirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Ngge itsu umum igɔr umbi ugɛ umbi awuri ikpe ra arhimmbi. Umbi awuri ikpe, umbi aba ashimbi ri imangmang ugɛ umum iwu unga hã umum iki ĩgɔr ĩgɛ umum iwe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Umbɔ adzipa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu ungamɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwe ru nyaka umum iki indɛyiwa umbi ri inggbaashia. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Umum iwu ra abina arhɛrhɛ umum iki irherhe ra atsimbi ni itsu umbi uvau. Bɔr uwuku adena umum awu undzumu uner idzidzɛrhe. Umum indɛyiwe anera ru upfung ubinkpi umum iki ĩgũ ru unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Umbɔ asi ihwɛngmbɔ ugɛ unga anu irherha arherhe ri itsi Utɛnga ra afã. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Nggee Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ivangyɛ umbi aka iberu Ungwɛ̃-Ner, ivang hã niyɔ umbi aka ihwɛng ugɛ awu umum iwu unga hã. Umbi awuri ihwɛngmbi ugɛ umum isi ikorhumum ubin ri ijee itsimum, bɔr umum irherhu abinkɛ Utɛ aka amesuwa umum ukpekũ. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Uwuku udena umum awu nggu umum, unga asi ínekanga umum ikiyikami, ubinkutsu ubɛn unum umum ikorhu ubinkpi unga aka agũibɛn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Mɔcɛ anera arhɛrhɛ aka agũ arherha akɛrɛ atsu imangmangmbɔ ru unga.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awɛkaci Uibrahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Uyesu agɔr abi Uyahuda ha aka awuri imangmang ru unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi aba akpɔmmbi imesamum, umbi awuri iwe angwɛ̃ imesamum abi idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Mɔcɛ umbi awuri ihwɛngmbi idzidzɛrhe, idzidzɛrhe iwuri ifɔnangge umbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn iwu anang Uibrahim, umɛn inasi iwemɛn agãrhũ unera. Awu use utsu ungo ugɔr ugɛ umɛn ikpomɛn ififɔnmɛn?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, uwuku utɔ̃itser arhim awu ugãrhã arhim. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Ugãrhã ashia ra anang ugbagbaa ri iya, bɔr ungwɛ̃ awea ra anang ri iya ha ugbagbaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Nggee Ungwɛ̃ aba adzaanga umbi ififɔn, umbi akpombi ififɔn idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Umum ihwɛng umbi awu anang Uibrahim. Bɔr umbi abee ifɛr umum, ubinkutsu umbi asi iyɛimbi irhɛmmum. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Umum isɔma umbi ubinkpi umum iki inyã ivangyɛ umum iki iwu nggu Utɛmum, bɔr umbi akorhu abinkɛ umbi aka agũ ru utɛmbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uibrahim unga awu utɛmɛn.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi aba awu angwɛ̃ Uibrahim, umbi awuri itɔ̃mbi itser Uibrahim aka atɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Iwu uner uwuku urherhi idzidzɛrhe umum iki igũ ru Unum, bɔr umbi abee ifɛre umum. Uibrahim asi ikorhunga ikpũ amɛn akɛrɛ ha. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Umbi amesi itser utɛmbi aki itɔ̃.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Abi Uyahuda atsɛyi agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn isi iwemɛn angwɛ̃ ugba. Unum ikiyikanga awu Utɛmɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Angwɛ̃ Undenggũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba Unum unga awu Utɛmbi, uda umbi aba abemumbi umum, umum idzeku Unum ĩba, icɛrɛ umum iwu nggimi. Umum isi ĩbamum nibikami, bɔr unga adena umum. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Awu use utsu umbi asi igũ ataimbi ubinkpi umum iki irherhe? Ubinkutsu umbi asi ibeembi ikpeto ra arherhamum. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Umbi awu abi utɛmbi, Undenggũ hã, nu umbi abee itɔ̃ itser ubin utɛmbi aka abee. Unga awu uner uwuku ufɛyi aner udzur ri inggbaashia, akpɛ̃ɛ̃ idzidzɛrhe, nu idzidzɛrhe ishingge ru unga. Ivangyɛ unga iki igbɛyi angwĩ, unga arherhe idũnga niyɔ, ubinkutsu unga awu uner igbɛrangwĩ nu utei igbɛrangwĩ. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Bɔr umbi ashimbi ri imangmang ru umum, ubinkutsu umum isɔm idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Ungamɔ ru umbi awuri isɔma uvau arhim ru umum? Umum ĩba irherhe idzidzɛrhe, awu use utsu umbi ashimbi ri imangmang ru umum? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Uwuruwi aka awe uwu Unum, aka isaka agɔm ikpeto ri irhɛm Unum iki irherhe. Umbi asi igũmbi ngge, ubinkutsu umbi asi iwembi abi Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ananga Uibrahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Abi Uyahuda agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea idzidzɛrhe umɛn iki igɔr ugɛ ungo uwu uner Usamariya uwuku uwe ru ipfu iyiki ibewe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ishimum ri ipfu iyiki ibewe, umum idzowe igɔng ru Utɛmum bɔr umbi asi idzaambi umum igɔng. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Umum isi ĩbeemum ikpoi itsimum, bɔr uwɔɔ ruwɔ abeenga ngge ru umum, nu unga hã awu uner uwuku utsu uvau. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, unera aba adɔsunga irhɛmmum, unga asi ínyãã akpe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Abi Uyahuda agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Icɛrɛ umɛn iki ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ ungo uweɔ ri ipfu iyiki ibewe! Uibrahim akpea nu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num akpembɔ, bɔr ungo ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;Unera aba adɔsunga irhɛmmum, unga asi ínyãã akpe.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Ungo unango utɛmɛn Uibrahim? Unga akpea. Rimi hã abika asɔm Arherhu-Num akpembɔ. Ungo ukaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ ungo uwu use?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ĩba ikpoi itsimum, ukpoimum usi iwekpɔ ubin. Utɛmum umbi aka agɔr agɛ awu Unummbi, awu unga akpoi umum. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Umbi asi ihwɛngmbi unga, bɔr umum ihwɛng unga. Umum iba ĩgɔr igɛ umum isi ihwɛng unga, umum iwu uner igbɛrangwĩ ru nyaka umbi. Bɔr umum ihwɛng unga, ni idɔsi irhɛmnga. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Utɛmbi Uibrahim agɔm anggɔm akarhãrhã ri ivangyɛ unga aka akaifɛrhkɔ inyã ivangyɛ umum iki ĩba. Unga anyã ngge na agɔm anggɔm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Abi Uyahuda agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo unasi itsĩɔ imɛka isɔka itɔ̃ɔ̃ kata, nu ugɔr ugɛ ungo unyãɔ Uibrahim?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, umum iwemum umbɔ adɔrha amar Uibrahim.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Nggee umbɔ arhɔ̃ĩ atarh abee itang unga, bɔr Uyesu awoi itsinga adzek abɔruka Iya-Num hã.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu akerhuwe uner itapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Uyesu azɛ̃rhã atɔng na anyã uner uwɔɔ umbɔ aka amar unga itapa. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, awu arhim uner uwurɛ use ateinga atsu umbɔ amar unga itapa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea arhim uner uwurɛ use aki ateinga. Amar unga itapa nu umbɔ adɛyiwe itser Unum ri itsinga. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Awu ufang umɛn itɔ̃ itseryɛ unga aka adena umum ri ivanga nu unuma una arhang umɔ. Utsuu ukpɔ ubarɔ ivangyɛ anera asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atɔ̃mbɔ itser. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Ivangyɛ umum iki iwu ru upfunga, umum iwu irhirhang upfunga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Unga aka arherhe rimi, unga atar aci ra abĩ, akayi abĩ nggu aci ha, na akũ abĩ hã atsu ake ra asu uner itapa ha. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>Agɔr uner itapa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uzĩ ru ukau Usirhuwam nu usorh asungo umɔ.&gt;&gt; Agben &lt;&lt;Usirhuwam&gt;&gt; agburh &lt;&lt;Adene unga.&gt;&gt; Nggee uner itapa ha azĩ asorh asunga, na abvui aba anyãã.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Andɔkanga nu abirabɛ aki inyã unga afɛn ifɛn arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea uner uwɛrɛ anu isei na afɛn ifɛn iyɛrɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Abɔɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu unga.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Abɔɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ, ayɛiyɛi ukpekũ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Bɔr uner itapa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu umum uner ha nuwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Umbɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo ukorhu uguse na asungo ayanga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner ha umbɔ iki iyisa Uyesu unga akũ aci akayi abĩ atsuka ra asumum, na agɔr umum agɛ, &lt;Uzĩ usorh asungo ru ukau Usirhuwam.&gt; Umum izĩ isorh, mɔcɛ umum ikpo inyã anang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Umbɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner ha awerɛ unga?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum isi ihwɛng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abi Ufarisi abee ihwɛng usu ikikerhe ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ akũ uner itapa ha asunga aka ayanga azĩmbɔ ra abi Ufarisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Awu ru unum ukpuku uwosha abi Uyahuda, Uyesu aka akayi abĩ hã akerhuwe asu uner itapa ha. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Nggee abi Ufarisi arhusa unga akorhu uguse na anyã anang. Uner itapa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga akayi abĩ atsuka ra asumum nu umum isorhe ake ni inyã ananga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Abi Ufarisi abɔɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner ha asi idzeka ru Unum, ubinkutsu unga asi itsamma unum ukpuku uwosha.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Bɔr abɔɔ arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner arhim awuri ikorha aguse na akorha abin idzeu nu atsar rimi?&gt;&gt; Nggee umbɔ agashumbɔ.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Mɔcɛ abi Ufarisi abvui arhusu utsa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo ugɔr ugɛ use ri itsi utsa ha? Awu asungo unga aka ayanguwa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Uner itapa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga awu uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Anggbaashi abi Uyahuda utsɛku icɛrɛ umbɔ ashimbɔ ri imangmang agɛ amar utsa ha nggu itapa, bɔr icɛrɛ unga aka anyã ananga. Akɛrɛ ha atsu umbɔ ayisa abika amar utsa ha. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Umbɔ arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uwɛrɛ awu ungwɛ̃mbi? Umbi aka agɔr agɛ amar unga itapa? Akorha aguse na anyã anang icɛrɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Abika amar uner itapa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn uwɛrɛ ha awu ungwɛ̃ imarmɛn, ikɛi umɛn imar unga adzeka nggu itapa. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Bɔr umɛn isi ihwɛngmɛn ubinkpi uku utsu unga anyã ananga icɛrɛ. Umɛn isi ihwɛngmɛn uwuku uyanguwe asunga. Àka arhusa unga. Unga asi iwea uwɛkuci. Unga awuri irherhunga ra angwĩnga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Abika amar unga arherhe rimi ubinkutsu umbɔ agũ iwei anggbaashi abi Uyahuda. Abi Uyahuda agɛ kishoo uwuku ugɔr agɛ Uyesu awu Ukiristo, umbɔ awuri iwiwayiwe uner ha adzek ru ubã ifɛn-Num. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Ngge itsu abika amar unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga asi iwea uwɛkuci, àka arhusa unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Ide uvaa abi Ufarisi abvui ayisu uner itapa ha aka akerhe, agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Udzowe Unum igɔng nu urherhi idzidzɛrhe. Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn uner uwuku ukerhuwa ungo awu uner arhim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga aba awu uner arhim, umum isi ihwɛng. Ubina unying umum iki ihwɛng, umum iwu itapa, icɛrɛ umum inyãmum ananga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ arhusa unga ikɛi agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga akorhuwa ungo use? Akorhu uguse na ayanguwa asungo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iki isɔmamum umbi, umbi asi ikpembi ato. Awu use utsu umbi abvui abee igigũ ikɛi? Use umbi abee iwu angwɛ̃ imesanga igambi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ arhenu utsa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ungo uwu ungwɛ̃ imesanga! Umɛn iwu awɛ imesu Umusa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn Unum arherhunga arherhe nggu Umusa, bɔr utsak uwurɛ umɛn isi ihwɛngmɛn anangkɛ unga aka adzek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Utsa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɛrɛ awu ubin idzeu! Umbi asi ihwɛngmbi anangkɛ unga aka adzek, bɔr ayanguwanga asumum! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn Unum aka isaka asi igũa abi arhim. Bɔr aka isaka agũa abi iwei unga na atɔ̃ itsernga. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Utirhi ri imimunu upfunga unera anasi igũa umbɔ ayangukumbɔ asu unerwi umbɔ aka amar unga nggu itapa. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Utsak uwurɛ aba asi idzeku Unum abanga, asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhunga ubin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Akɛrɛ atsu umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo umbɔ aka amar ra arhim, nu ungo ubee imesuwa umɛn?&gt;&gt; Umbɔ awayikumbɔ unga.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itapa iyi ipfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Uyesu agũ isarhunga ugɛ umbɔ aka awayikumbɔ utsa ha. Ivang Uyesu aka akpo utsa ha, unga arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uweɔ ri imangmang ru Ungwɛ̃-Ner?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Uner itapa ha aka akerhe arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;A uteiya, awu ungamɔ? Udɛyiwa umum nu umum iwe ru imangmang ru unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo unyãɔ unga icɛrɛ. Awu unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ arherhe nggu ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Mɔcɛ utsa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, umum iwemum ri imangmang,&gt;&gt; na adzowe unga igɔng.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum itsĩwã itsu uvau ru upfung ukpirɛ, ngge itsú abi itapa anyã, abika anyunyã ikɛi awe abi itapa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Abi Ufarisi ha abika akhapa ru unga aka agũ rimi, umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn iwu abi itapa igamɛn?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi aba awu abi itapa, umbi asi iwembi ru uvau arhim, bɔr umbi agɔr agɛ umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ anyãmbi, nggee arhimmbi awe umɔ.<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Uner ughãwã nu ídɔinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>&lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, unerwi aka asi itsĩa ra angwĩ ugbor idɔi, bɔr na afũ udika afɛn akase atsĩ, uner ha awu uvɛu nu uwuku uvui abin. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Unerwi aka atsĩ ra angwĩ ugbora unga awu uner ughãwã idɔi ha. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Uner uwuku udzɛu angwĩ ugbora aka isaka atsuruwe angwĩ ugbora ru unga. Ídɔi ha ikɛi iki isaki ikpeto ru urhɛmnga. Unga aka isaka ayisi ídɔinga nggu atsokngge akũ adzeka awiya. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka ikũ iyinga adzek, unga agbaashia nu ídɔinga idɔsa unga, ubinkutsu ngge ihwɛngngge urhɛmnga. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Bɔr isi ídɔsungge utsen, ngge iwuri itĩ, ubinkutsu ngge imɔrngge urhɛm utsen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Uyesu akũ nyaka arherhe akɛrɛ asɔme anera, bɔr umbɔ asi ihwɛngmbɔ ubin unga aka arherhuwe umbɔ.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu awu uner idzɛu uwuku uze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Nggee Uyesu ikɛi agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, awu umum iwu angwĩ ugbor ídɔi ha. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Kishoo abika agbaashia aba ru umum ĩdɔrhi ĩba awu avɛu nu abika avui abin, bɔr ídɔi ha isi idɔsungge umbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Awu umum iwu angwĩ ugbora. Ubɛn unera aka atsĩ ru ubokmum awuri ikpoa ififɔrh, awuri itsĩ na adzek akpo ubĩĩ uku uze. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Uvɛu aba ivivɛu na afɛre na adakuwe. Umum ĩba ru umbɔ akpo urhɛ, akpo umgbɔ uku kpengkpeng.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>&lt;&lt;Awu umum iwu uner idzɛu uwuku uze ha. Uner idzɛu uwuku uze ha adzowe urhɛnga ri ídɔinga. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Unerwi iki itɔ̃ itser imang asi iwea uner idzɛu, ídɔi ha ikɛi isi iwengge iyinga. Ivangyɛ unga aka inyã ijui ngbako iki itĩ iba, unga awuri ineke idɔi ha na atĩã. Ijui ngbako ha idzui ngge ni isituwe ngge. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Uner ha awuri itĩ, ubinkutsu unga atɔ̃ itser imang ukpekũ nu ubin usi íghongkpɔ amɛnnga ri idzɛu ídɔi ha.<verse eid="JHN 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>&lt;&lt;Awu umum iwu uner idzɛu uwuku uze. Umum ihwɛng ídɔimum nu ídɔimum ihwɛngngge umum. <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>Rimi hã Utɛmum ahwɛnga umum nu umum ihwɛng Utɛ, ni iwuri indzowukũ urhɛmum ri ídɔi ha. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Iwemum ri ídɔi iyɔɔ iki isi iwengge iyi ugbor idɔi ukpirɛ. Awu ufang umum ikũna ngge ĩba ikɛi. Ngge iwuri ikpengge ato ru urhɛmmum, ni ídɔi ha iwuri iwu ukpusha unying uner ughãwã unying. <verse eid="JHN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>Utɛ abema umum ubinkutsu umum iwuri ingwɛ̃we urhɛmum, ugɛ umum ibvui inyanga umgbɔ ikɛi. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Unera asi ívura urhɛmum, umum nibikami iwuri ingwɛ̃we umgbɔ. Iwemum ri ijee iyiki ingwɛ̃we umgbɔ nu ijee iyiki inyanga umgbɔ ikɛi. Awu Utɛmum atsu umum ikorhe akɛrɛ ha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Irhɛm arherhe iyɛrɛ itsu abi Uyahuda agasha nggu adɔka ikɛi. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Anera arhɛrhɛ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awea ri ipfu iyiki ibewe ngge itsu unga ukpong. Awu use utsu umbi akpeto ru unga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Bɔr abɔɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ, arherhe akɛrɛ asi iweke aki uner uku uwe nggu ipfu iyiki ibewe. Ipfu iyiki ibewe idɛ̃ɛ̃ iyangungge asu uner itapa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abi Uyahuda akpɛ̃mbɔ Uyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Awu ri ivang umbɔ aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ Irhowa iyiki Iyɛruwe Iya-Num ru Urusharhima, <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Uyesu azɛ̃rhã ru angwĩ iya Usorhomon ri Iya-Num hã. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Abi Uyahuda akɔng adziir unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsɛku ukang ungo uku ineka umɛn ri icicang? Ungo uba uwu Ukiristo, udɛyiwa umɛn ra awiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iki idɛyiwamum umbi, umbi ashimbi ri imangmang. Abin idzeukɛ umum iki ikorhe ri itsok Utɛmum, ake adɛyiwe umum iwu ungamɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Bɔr umbi ashimbi ri imangmang, ubinkutsu umbi asi iwembi ídɔimum. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Ídɔimum ikpeto ru urhɛmmum, umum ihwɛng ngge, ngge idɔsa umum. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Umum ĩdzowe ngge urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa, ngge isi íkpengge ugbagbaa, unera asi ívura ngge ru ubokmum. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Utɛmum uwuruwi aka adzaa ngge ru umum, unga ananga kishoo. Unera asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ avura ngge ru ubok Utɛmum. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Umum nu Utɛ iwu unying.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Abi Uyahuda abvui arhɔ̃ĩ atarh abee itang unga. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Bɔr Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iki ikorhuwamum umbi abin idzeu arhɛrhɛ akika agɔng aka adzeku Utɛ. Akikasong awuri itsu umbi afɛre umum nggu atarh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Abi Uyahuda agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea itser iyiki izengo itsu umɛn ibee itang atarh ru ungo, bɔr arherhe urhenango ru Unum, ubinkutsu ungo uwu unera nu unyangi itsingo uwu Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi itsɛngmbɔ ri Íkpemmbi ugɛ Unum agɔr agɛ, &lt;Umum igɔr ugɛ umbi awu anum&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Amb 82.6</ref></char>.</note>? <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num iwu idzidzɛrhe. Uba unga ayisa abika adzowe Arherhu-Num agɛ &lt;anum&gt;, <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>mɔcɛ umbi agɔr aguse ri itsi uwu ha Utɛ aka atsũ unga awu uwu unga na adene unga aba ru upfunga? Awu use utsu umbi agɔr ugɛ umum ini irhenu Unum ri ivangyɛ umum iki irherhe ugɛ, &lt;Umum iwu Ungwɛ̃ Unum&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Uba umum isi ikorhumum abinkɛ Utɛmum aki ikorhe, àka aneke iwe ru imangmang ru umum. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Bɔr umum ĩba ikorha ake, umbi aba ashimbi ri imangmang ru umum, àka awe ru imangmang ra abin idzeu ha umum iki ikorhe, na ahwɛng agɛ Utɛ awea ru umum, nu umum iwemum ru Utɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Ikɛi umbɔ abee idzur unga, bɔr unga ashɔɔta ra abokmbɔ.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu abvui agar Azɛ̃ Urdun azĩã anangkɛ Uyohana aka asorhuwe ubɔtisima isha na aseisa umɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Umɔ anera arhɛrhɛ aka aba ru unga. Anera ani igɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyohana anasi ikorhunga atsar abin idzeu, bɔr kishoo abinkɛ unga aka arherhe ri itsi utsak uwurɛ awu idzidzɛrhe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Ra anang hã anera arhɛrhɛ aka awe ru imangmang ru Uyesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Akpe Urhiazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Unera nuwɔ itsoka igburh Urhiazaru aghonga unga. Awu ru uteu Ubetani, uku uwu uteumbɔ Umaryamu nu Umarta unapumbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Urhiazaru uwuku ughong hã awu ungwɛ̃mbɔ Umaryamu, uwuku udzukuwe atsei isung nú Uteijee, na akũ igwar itsinga afire adaknga. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Nggee anaa uyi ha ikivarhambɔ adene itser ru Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, uwu ha ungo uku ubema aghonga unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Ivang Uyesu aka agũ rimi unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Irhãrhã hã isi ítsu unga akpea, bɔr iwuri ikũ ikpikpoi iba ru Unum nu Ungwɛ̃nga ikɛi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Uyesu abemu Umarta nu unapumbɔ nu Urhiazaru. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Bɔr ivangyɛ unga aka agũ ugɛ Urhiazaru aghonga unga, unga atoma aseisa inuma ivaa ru nggɔɔ ha.<verse eid="JHN 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn ibvui izĩ Uyahudiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga hã agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, inum iyɛrɛ abi Uyahuda abee ifɛre ungo nggu atarh, nu ungo ubvui uzĩ nggɔɔ ha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea akara usɔkdũmɛn ru unuma unying ishaa unum iki irhang? Kishoo uwuku uzɛ̃rhã ra atenum asi íkwɛra itok, ubinkutsu, unga anyãã irhirhang upfung ukpirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Bɔr uwuku uzɛ̃rhã ru utsuu awuri ikwɛra itok, ubinkutsu irhirhang ishingge ru unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Ivangyɛ Uyesu aka arherha abina akɛrɛ amaa, unga atoma agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uwɛrhamɛn Urhiazaru aka arharhɔ, bɔr umum izĩ izita unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga hã agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, aba awu urhɔ, unga awuri ikerhunga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Ubin Uyesu aka arherhe agɛ Urhiazaru aka akpea, bɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga akaifɛrhkɔ agɛ unga arherha arherhe urhɔ uwuku uwosha.<verse eid="JHN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Nggee Uyesu adɛyiwe umbɔ ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Urhiazaru aka akpea. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>Umum igɔm umum iki isi iwemum umɔ, ngge ima itsu umbi awe ru imangmang. Bɔr umɛn izĩmɛn ru unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Mɔcɛ Utoma, uwuruwi umbɔ iki iyisa unga Akãrhghwɛ̃, agɔr abimbɔ angwɛ̃ imesa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn izĩmɛn ikɛi, nu umɛn ikpe nggu unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu adɔnge amɛn anaa uyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Ivangyɛ Uyesu aka azĩ atsĩ, agũ ugɛ Urhiazaru aka akpea, umbɔ aka adzake unga, aka amaa inuma inaa ru udzak. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Ubetani ukhapa nggu Urusharhima, asi itsĩa akirhomita ataar. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Abi Uyahuda arhɛrhɛ aba ighwe akpe Urhiazaru ru anapumbɔ na adɔnge amɛn Umarta nu Umaryamu.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Ivangyɛ Umarta aka agũ ugɛ Uyesu uwɔ abarɔ, unga asok azĩ agbanga unga. Bɔr Umaryamu asei ri iya.<verse eid="JHN 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Umarta agɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, agɛ ungo uwu nggimi ungwɛ̃mɛn asi íkpea. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Bɔr uko icɛrɛ umum ihwɛng Unum awuri idzaanga kishoo ubinkpi ungo iki ishɔ̃rhã unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɛ̃mbi awuri isoka ikɛi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Umarta agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ihwɛng awuri ibɛka ikɛi ri isisok abika akpukpe ri imimashu upfung.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu umum iwu isisok abika akpukpe, ikɛi awu umum iwu urhɛ. Uwuruwi aka awea ri imangmang ru umum unga awuri ibɛka, uko unga aka akpea. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Uwuruwi aka abɛk na awea ri imangmang ru umum asi íkpea ugbagbaa. Ungo uweɔ ri imangmang akɛrɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Mɔcɛ Umarta agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ, Uteijee, umum iwemum ri imangmang ugɛ awu ungo uwu Ukiristo ha, Ungwɛ̃ Unum uwuruwi umɛn iki ifosa ugɛ unga ibanga ru upfung.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu aciu akpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Ivangyɛ Umarta aka arherhe rimi, unga abvui azĩ ayisu unapumbɔ Umaryamu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umarhem aka abanga na ayisa ungo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Ivangyɛ Umaryamu aka agũ rimi, unga asok ifefetem azĩã ru unga. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Uyesu anasi itsĩa ru utepa kata. Unga ana awu ra anangkɛ Umarta aka agbanga unga. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Ivang abi Uyahuda abika asei ifaakpe ri iya Umaryamu aka anyã unga asok iki ifefetem adzek, umbɔ adɔsa unga akaifɛrhkɔ agɛ unga awuri izĩ ra anang udzaka na aciu akpe umɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Ivang Umaryamu aka azĩ atsĩ ra anangkɛ Uyesu aka awe, unga aka anyã unga, unga agba anu ra adak Uyesu na agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, agɛ ungo uwu nggimi, ungwɛ̃mɛn asi íkpea.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Ivang Uyesu aka anyã unga aciu akpe, nu abi Uyahuda ha aka aba nggu unga aciu akpe igambɔ, mɔcɛ amɛn Uyesu aghong akarhãrhã. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Unga arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi adzake unga rinɛɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, uba unyã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Uyesu aciu akpe.<verse eid="JHN 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Mɔcɛ abi Uyahuda agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka anyã ikpũ ibibemayɛ unga aka awerangge ru Urhiazaru!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Bɔr abɔɔ ru umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga ayanguwe asu uner itapa uwɔrɔ. Awu use utsu unga asi ikorhunga ubin ukpɔɔ iki ikɛn utsak uwurɛ ikpikpe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu azituka Urhiazaru ra akpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Uyesu abvui agũ ighong ra amɛnnga akarhãrhã. Azĩã ru udzak ha. Udzak ha uwu utai. Akũ ubatu utarh afɔme angwĩ udzaka. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka aberuwe utarh ha.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Bɔr Umarta, unapumbɔ uwuku akpukpe ha, agɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, icɛrɛ aka awu anunukawɔ. Irherɛ unum unaa nukpi unga aka akpe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Isi isɔmamum ungo ugɛ ungo uba uweɔ ri imangmang, ungo uwuri inyãɔ̃ igɔng Unum?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Nggee umbɔ atsimuwe utarh ha. Uyesu abera asunga afafã na agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Utɛ, umum itar uwɛɛ ungo uku ugũo umum. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Umum ihwɛng ubɛn unum ungo ugũo umum, bɔr umum irherhe rimi ru anera abika adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggimi awe ru imangmang ugɛ awu ungo udena umum ĩba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka arherhe rimi, Uyesu atsarhi irhaknga ikerketangge agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Urhiazaru, udzeka!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Uner uwuku ukpe ha adzeka, adaknga na aboknga abow nggu atatorho, asunga ikɛi abɛrh nggu atorho. Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka agarhuwe unga azĩã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abee ifɛr Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Umat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Umar 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Irh 22.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Nggee abi Uyahuda arhɛrhɛ aka aba ighwe akpe ru Umaryamu na anyã ubinkpi Uyesu aka akorhe, umbɔ awe ru imangmang ru unga. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Bɔr abɔɔ azĩmbɔ ra abi Ufarisi, adɛyiwe umbɔ ubinkpi Uyesu aka akorhe. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Mɔcɛ ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num nu abi Ufarisi akɔng anggbaashi abi Uyahuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:47">Arhusa adɔka agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn ikorhu usemɛn? Utsak uwurɛ anu ikorha atsar abin idzeu arhɛrhɛ! <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Umɛn ĩba ineke unga akorhunga abin hã, anera kishoo awuri iwe ru imangmang ru unga. Mɔcɛ abi Uroma awuri iba avurmbɔ abĩmɛn nu Iya-Nummɛn ikɛi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Bɔr unying ru umbɔ agburh Ukayafa Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num ra amɛk aki ha, agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi asi ihwɛngmbi ubin! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Umbi asi irhi ataimbi ugɛ ugba unera unying akpe ri itsi anera, nu abĩmɛn aki itsim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Arherha ha Ukayafa aka arherhe asi iweke ifɛrhkɔ amɛnnga, bɔr unga aka awu Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num ra amɛk ha na asɔm Arherhu-Num ugɛ Uyesu awuri ikpe ri itsi aner abi Uyahuda. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Unga asi íkpea ra abi Uyahuda ukpekũ, bɔr unga awuri ikɔng aner Unum abirabɛ aka asita ru upfunga umbɔ awu unying. <verse eid="JHN 11:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Nggee udzur ru unum hã anggbaashi abi Uyahuda avarhi ifɛr Uyesu.<verse eid="JHN 11:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Nggee Uyesu asi ibvui azɛ̃rhũnga ra abi Uyahuda ukupɛ̃ɛ̃, bɔr asoka ra anang hã, azĩã abĩkɛ aka akhapa ra arhum. Atsĩã uteu ukpɔɔ umbɔ iki iyisa Uifrayim na aseisa umɔ nggu angwɛ̃ imesanga.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng iyi abi Uyahuda iki iyok. Anera arhɛrhɛ aka adzeki iteu iki ici azĩ Urusharhima, ugɛ umbɔ asare atsimbɔ ru irhowa ha idɔrhi iwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Atɛ̃wã abee Uyesu, adesa ra Iya-Num anu irhusa adɔka agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi akaifɛrhkɔ use? Awuri ibanga irhowa ha idĩã?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Bɔr ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num nu abi Ufarisi aka adzowukumbɔ itser ugɛ kishoo uwuku uhwɛng anangkɛ Uyesu aka awe, unga aba asɔme umbɔ nu umbɔ azĩ adzur unga.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Adzukuwe atsei isung nú Uyesu <optbreak/> ru Ubetani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Umat 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Umar 14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng ibɔr inuma utɔ̃ĩ, Uyesu atsĩ Ubetani, anangkɛ unga aka azituwe Urhiazaru ra akpe. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Umɔ umbɔ aka akorhuwe Uyesu ubingha urhɛɛ. Awu Umarta unga agashu ubingha ha, Urhiazaru awu unying ra anera abika agha ubingha ha nggu Uyesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Mɔcɛ Umaryamu anyangu ungwɛ̃rhũ undzoma atsei isung aki imang umbɔ aka akũ unardi agbisha na adzukuwe ra adak Uyesu. Mɔcɛ unga akũ igwar itsinga afire. Isung iyiki ize iyi atsei ha imaangge iya kishoo.<verse eid="JHN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Bɔr Uyahuda Uiskariyoti, unying ra angwɛ̃ imesanga, uwuruwi aka igha-daknga, agɔr agɛ, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>&lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbɔ asi igoshukumbɔ atsei isung hã akirakɛ imanga iki iwu iyi uner itser ra amɛka, na adzowukumbɔ imanga ra atsũwã?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Ubinkutsu unga arherhe rimi, asi igũã ighong atsũwã, bɔr ubinkutsu unga awu uvɛu. Unga akpɔm ijari imangmbɔ, unga aka isaka ayikuka itsinga ri imang hã.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka aneke unga. Unga aden ake adzɛu unumkpi umbɔ aka idzake umum. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Atsũwã awu nggu umbi ubɛn unum, bɔr umbi asi íwembi nggu umum ubɛn unuma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abee ikorhuwe Urhiazaru iki ibewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Ri ivang hã ikikɔng abi Uyahuda irhɛirhɛ iki igũ ugɛ Uyesu awu umɔ, umbɔ aba. Asi ibambɔ inyã Uyesu ikiyikanga, bɔr abee inyã Urhiazaru uwu ha Uyesu aka azituwe unga ra akpe. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num avarhe ifɛre Urhiazaru ikɛi. <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>Ubinkutsu awu arherhe Urhiazaru ake atsu abi Uyahuda arhɛrhɛ ani idzipa awe ru imangmang ru Uyesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu atsĩã Urusharhima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Umat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Umar 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Irh 19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Ukpe unum uvaa anera arhɛrhɛ aka aba Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng agũ ugɛ Uyesu awu ru utsĩndĩ uwuku uba Urusharhima. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Umbɔ arhɔ̃ĩ angbɔk irhek, akũ azĩ agbopa unga, atsarhi irhakmbɔ agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;Ikpikpoi iwe ru Unum!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Amb 118.25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Idorh Unum iwu nggu uwu ha aka aba ri itsok Uteijee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">idorh Unum iwu nggu uyɛrhe Uisrairha!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Uyesu aka akpo ungwɛ̃ uzhika unga afũ asei nú umgbɔ, ru nyaki itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr ugɛ,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>&lt;&lt;Niba agũmbi iwei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">umbi aner Urusharhima.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">Uyɛrhambi uwɔ aba nú undzing ungwɛ̃ uzhika!&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Uzak 9.9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Ri inggbaashia angwɛ̃ imesanga asi ihwɛngmbɔ kishoo abin hã. Bɔr ivang Unum aka asoyiwe Uyesu ra akpe na akpoi unga, mɔcɛ umbɔ ayita ugɛ atsɛngmbɔ abin hã ri itsinga, nu abin hã akorhuke ru unga.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Anerabɛ aka awu nggu unga ri ivangyɛ unga aka ayisu Urhiazaru unga adzeka ru udzak na azituwe unga ra akpe, ani idekuwe anera ubinkpi Uyesu aka akorhe. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Anera arhɛrhɛ aka azĩ agbangu Uyesu ubinkutsu umbɔ agũ utsar ubin idzeu ha unga aka akorhe. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Nggee abi Ufarisi arherhe arherhe nggu adɔkambɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka anyã, umɛn isi ighamɛn inggbaashi. Nggayɛ kishoo upfunga adɔsa unga!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abi Uherhini abɔɔ abee Uyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Icɛ abɔɔ rabɔ abi Uherhini aka aba idzowe igɔng ri irhowa. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Umbɔ aba ru Ufirhibu, uner Ubetsaida ru Ugarhirhi, arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteiya, umɛn ibee inyã Uyesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Ufirhibu azĩ asɔmuka Uandarawu. Umbɔ ikivarhambɔ azĩ asɔmukumbɔ Uyesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ivang iyiki ikpoi Ungwɛ̃-Ner iki iwengge. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, umbɔ aba asi inaambɔ ishaa itsem ra abĩ ngge ikpengge, ngge iwe ikiyikangge. Bɔr ngge iba ikpengge, ngge ighwɛr ishaanga irhɛirhɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Uwuruwi aka abemu urhɛnga, umgbɔ uwuri igwirmgbɔ. Bɔr uwuruwi aka akpɛ̃ɛ̃ urhɛnga ru upfung ukpirɛ, awuri iwe ru urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Ubɛn uwuku utɔ̃ itsermum, awu ufang unga adɔsa umum. Nu anangkɛ umum iki iwe, ugãrhãmum ikɛi awuri iwe umɔ. Utɛmum awuri itomuka imor ru uwu ha aka awu ugãrhãmum.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu arherha arherhe ra akpenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>&lt;&lt;Icɛrɛ umum ĩgũ ighong ra amɛnmum. Umum ĩgɔr ugɛ use? &lt;A Utɛ, ufɔrh umum ri ivang iyɛrɛ&gt;? Ĩ'ĩ, awu ubin ivang iyɛrɛ itsu umum ĩba. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>A Utɛ, ukũ ikpikpoi uba ri itsokngo!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Mɔcɛ urhɛm udzeka afã ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iki ikpoishũ ike, ni ibvui ikpikpoimum ike ikɛi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Anera abika adɛ̃ɛ̃ umɔ aka agũ urhɛm hã, umbɔ agɛ inai irhare. Abɔɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ipfu itser-Num ngge irherha arherhe nggu unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Urhɛm ukpirɛ uba ru umbi, usi ibakpɔ ru umum. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Icɛrɛ awu ivangyɛ umbɔ aka ivarha arherhe ru upfung ukpirɛ. Icɛrɛ umbɔ aka awuri iwayiwe uyɛrhe upfung ukpirɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Bɔr ivangyɛ umbɔ aka ibera umum ra abĩ, umum uwuri idarha anera kishoo umbɔ aba ru umum.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Unga arherhe akɛrɛ adɛyiwe ikpũ akpekɛ unga aka ikpe.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Anera agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Íkpemmɛn idɛyiwa umɛn igɛ Ukiristo awuri ibɛk ugbagbaa. Mɔcɛ awu use utsu ungo ugɔr ugɛ awu ufang umbɔ aberuwe Ungwɛ̃-Ner? Ungamɔ awu Ungwɛ̃-Ner ha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Irhirhang hã iwu nggu umbi ivanga ukunjiir. Àka azɛ̃rhã ri irhirhang hã, utsur uzĩ unangkpɔ umbi. Uner uzɛ̃rhã ru uzĩ amɔra anangkɛ unga aka izĩ. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Ivang umbi aka ana awe nggu irhirhang hã àka awe ru imangmang ri ngge, ugɛ umbi ama awu angwɛ̃ irhirhang hã.&gt;&gt; Ivang Uyesu aka amaa arherhe, unga azĩ awoinga ri inyĩnyãmbɔ.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abi Uyahuda akpɛ̃mbɔ <optbreak/> iwe ru imangmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Uko arhɛrha atsar abin idzeu ha Uyesu aka akorhe ra asumbɔ, utsɛku icɛrɛ umbɔ ashimbɔ ri imangmang ru unga. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Akɛrɛ ha akorhe rimi ngge itsuifɛr ubinkpi uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num Uishaya aka arherhe agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">&lt;&lt;A Uteijee, ungamɔ awe ru imangmang ri isarhamɛn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Ru ungamɔ ikɛi umbɔ aka adɛyiwe ijee Uteijee?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Uish 53.1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Ngge itsu umbɔ asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ awembɔ ri imangmang, ru nyaku Uishaya aka arherhe ra anang akɔɔ agɛ,<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>&lt;&lt;Unga aka atsu umbɔ itapa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">na abĩruwe amɛnmbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ngge itsú umbɔ asi ínyãmbɔ nggu asumbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">na asi íhwɛngmbɔ ra amɛnmbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">na asi ídzipumbɔ ru umum ikerhuwe umbɔ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Uish 6.10</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Uishaya arherhe rimi ubinkutsu unga anyã ikpikpoi Uyesu, na arherhunga arherhe ri itsinga.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Rimi hã anera arhɛrhɛ aka awe ru imangmang ru Uyesu, nu anggbaashimbɔ arhɛrhɛ aka awe ru imangmang ru unga. Bɔr umbɔ asi irherhumbɔ ukupɛ̃ɛ̃, umbɔ agũ iwei abi Ufarisi aka iwayiwe umbɔ ru ubã ifɛn-Num. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Ubinkutsu umbɔ abema ikpikpoi iyi anera anangmbɔ ikpikpoi iyi Unum.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Arherhu Uyesu awuri itsu uvau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu atsarhi irhaknga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ivang unera aka awe ru imangmang ru umum, asi iwea ri imangmang ru umum ukpekũ, bɔr nggu uwuku udena umum ĩba. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka irhi umum, awuri inyã uwu ha aka adena umum ĩba. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Umum ĩba ru nyaki irhirhang ru upfung, ngge itsú kishoo uwuku uwe ru imangmang ru umum asi íseisa ru uzĩ.<verse eid="JHN 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>&lt;&lt;Uwuku ugũ irhɛmmum bɔr asi idɔsunga, asi iwea umum iwuri itsuke unga uvau. Umum isi ĩbamum itsu uvau ru upfung, bɔr umum ĩba ififɔrh ukpɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Uwuruwi aka akpɛ̃ɛ̃ umum na asi iyɛsa arherhamum awea ru uwuku utsu unga uvau. Arherha ha umum iki irherhe awuri itsuke unga uvau ru unum ukpuku umasha. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Ubinkutsu, umum isi irherhumum ubinkpi umum iki ibee, bɔr Utɛ uwuku udena umum unga atsuka ubinkpi umum iki irherhe nu utsĩndĩwi umum iki irherhe. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Umum ihwɛng arherhanga awuri ikũ urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa aba. Nggee ubɛn ubinkpi umum iki irherhe, umum irherhe ubinkpi Utɛ aka adɛyiwa umum irherhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu asorh adak angwɛ̃ imesanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng inasi iwengge. Uyesu aka ahwɛnga ugɛ ivanga iki iwengge unga aka ibɔre upfung ukpirɛ na abvui azĩ ru Utɛ. Unga aka abema anernga aka awe ru upfung, uko uzĩ utsĩ imimashu urhɛnga.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Uyesu nu angwɛ̃ imesanga aka asei igha urhɛɛ. Undenggũ aka atsukuka ra amɛn Uyahuda Uiskariyoti ungwɛ̃ Usiman unga agha-dak Uyesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Uyesu ikɛi ahwɛnga ugɛ Utɛ atsuke abina kishoo ru uboknga. Ahwɛnga unga adzeku Unum aba, ikɛi unga abvui azĩ ru Unum. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Ivang umbɔ aka asei igha ubingha, Uyesu asok atsimuwe atorhanga aki awiya na anyangu utawurh abow ru upfurhsĩnga. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Mɔcɛ unga atsu amɛ̃ ri itɛ̃rhãzɔu na atirhi isorh adak angwɛ̃ imesanga, na akũ utawurh ukpu upfurhsĩnga hã awɔnge.<verse eid="JHN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Unga aba ru Ubitru, Ubitru agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, awu ungo uwuri isorh adakmum?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Icɛrɛ ungo usi uhwɛngo ubinkpi umum iki ikorhe, bɔr ivanga ungo uwuri ihwɛngngo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ! Ungo usi ísorhɔ adakmum.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ĩba isi isorhamum ungo, ungo ishiɔ ru ugau ru umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, asi iwea adakmum ukpekũ ungo iki isorh, bɔr usorh nggu abokmum nu itsimum ikɛi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unerwi aka asorhi iyor, akpurha asorh adaknga ukpekũ, iyornga kishoo iki itɛngge. Umbi awu atɛtɛn, bɔr asi iwea umbi kishoo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Uyesu ahwɛnga uwuku ughadaknga, ngge itsu unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea umbi kishoo awu atɛtɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Unga aka asorh adakmbɔ amaa, unga atsim atorhanga, abvui azĩã ra anang iseinga. Unga arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi ahwɛngmbi ubinkpi umum iki ikorhuwa umbi? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Umbi ayisa umum Umarhem nu Uteijee, iwe rimi, ubinkutsu umum iwe rimi hã. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Umum iwu Uteijee nu Umarhemmbi. Ngge iki iwe ugɛ umum isorha adakmbi, imɛ̃ngge umbi asorh adak adɔkambi. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi utsĩndĩã. Àka akorhuwe abɔɔ ubinkpi umum iki ikorhuwa umbi. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, ugãrhã asi inanga uteiyanga, uner itser ikɛi asi inanga uwuku udene unga. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Icɛrɛ iki iwe ugɛ umbi ahwɛngmbi abin akɛrɛ, Unum awuri itsukanga umbi idorh umbi aba akorhumbi ake.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu agɔr agɛ awuri ighambɔ adaknga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Umat 26.20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Umar 14.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Irh 22.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>&lt;&lt;Isi irherhumum akɛrɛ ri itsimbi kishoo. Umum ihwɛng abirabɛ umum iki isɛng. Bɔr awu ufang ngge itsuifɛr ubinkpi uku utsɛng ra Arherhu-Num ugɛ, &lt;Uwuku ugha ubinghamum asok awu unggamtsakmum.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Amb 41.9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>&lt;&lt;Umum idɛyiwa umbi icɛrɛ ni ngge idɔrhi ikorhe, nggee ivangyɛ ngge iki ikorhe umbi awuri iwembi ri imangmang ugɛ umum iwu unga hã. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, uwuku uyɛi ubɛn uwuruwi umum iki idene, ayɛi umum, nu uwuku uyɛi umum, ayɛi uwuku udena umum ĩba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Ivang Uyesu aka arherha akɛrɛ amaa, unga agũ ighong akarhãrhã ra amɛnnga na adeka ra awiya agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, unying ru umbi awuri ighaa adakmum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga arhi adɔka. Asi ihwɛngmbɔ ungwɛ̃ imesa uwu ha Uyesu aka arherhe ri itsinga. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Unying ru umbɔ angwɛ̃ imesa ha, uwuruwi Uyesu aka abema, asei akhapa ru Uyesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Ubitru akũ uboknga agɔr Uyohana agɛ, &lt;&lt;Urhusa unga, uwukusong unga aka arherha arherha ha ri itsinga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Ungwɛ̃ imesa ha agɔpa azĩ ru Uyesu arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu uwukusong Uteijee?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uwuruwi umum iki itsɔɔr uborodi irhɔma ri itɛ̃rhãzɔu indzowe, awu unga nuwɔ.&gt;&gt; Mɔcɛ, unga aka arhɔmu uborodi adzowe ru Uyahuda ungwɛ̃ Usiman Uiskariyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Kanying Uyahuda aka ayɛi uborodi ha, Ushaitan atsĩ ru unga. Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubin hã ungo iki ikorhe, ukorhe ifetem.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Bɔr umbɔ abika agha ubingha ha nggu unga asi ihwɛngmbɔ ubinkpi uku utsu Uyesu arherhe rimi hã. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Ngge iki iwu ugɛ Uyahuda unga akpɔm ijari imangmbɔ, umɔ abɔɔ ra angwɛ̃ imesa ha akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ Uyesu asɔme unga igoi ubin ukpɔɔ umbɔ aka abee ri irhowa ha, use unga azĩ adzowe atsũwã ubin ukpɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Uyahuda ayɛi uborodi ha na adzeka. Utsuu ufin.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu asɔme arherhe ikpem iki ifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Uyahuda aka adzek, Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Icɛrɛ umbɔ aka ikpoi Ungwɛ̃-Ner na akpoi Unum ru uboknga. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Unum aba ayɛisa ikpikpoi ru uboknga, Unum awuri idzowuka Ungwɛ̃ɛ̃ ikpikpoi, nu unga awuri idzowuka unga ikpikpoi kanying.<verse eid="JHN 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>&lt;&lt;Umbi angwɛ̃mum abika acia, abɔr ivanga ukunjiir umum iki iwu nggu umbi. Umbi awuri ibeembi umum, bɔr ru nyaka umum iki idɛyiwe anggbaashi abi Uyahuda, rimi hã umum iki idɛyiwa umbi icɛrɛ inggɛ, &lt;Anangkɛ umum iki iwuri izĩ, umbi asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ abambi.&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>&lt;&lt;Awu ikpem iyiki ifa umum iki ĩdzaa umbi, àka abema adɔka. Ru nyaka umum iki ibema umbi, awu ufang umbi abema adɔka. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Rimi hã itsu ubɛn unera awuri ihwɛngnga ugɛ umbi awu angwɛ̃ imesamum, umbi aba abemumbi adɔka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubitru awuri itsɛyinga ihwɛng Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Umat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Umar 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Irh 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Usiman Ubitru arhusu Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, ungo izĩnɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Anangkɛ umum iki izĩ ungo usi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ udɔsungo umum icɛrɛ, bɔr unum ukpɔɔ ungo uwuri idɔsungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Ubitru arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, awu use utsu umum isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ idɔsumum ungo icɛrɛ? Umum iwuri idzowukũ urhɛmum ri itsingo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwuri idzowukɔ urhɛngo ri itsimum? Umum indɛyiwa ungo idzidzɛrhe, ungo uwuri itsɛyingo ihwɛng umum idikunga itaar ni ikɔ idɔrhi igbɛr ukpee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu unga awu utsĩndĩ <optbreak/> uwuku izĩ ru Utɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>&lt;&lt;Niba agũmbi ighong ra amɛnmbi. Àka awe ri imangmang ru Unum, ikɛi aka awe ri imangmang ru umum. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Ri iya Utɛmum abã awu arhɛrhɛ, Umum iwuri izĩ nggɔɔ ha izĩ igbishuwa anang ru umbi. Iba isi iwengge rimi, umbi atsar ugɛ umum isi ídɛyiwamum umbi? <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Umum ĩba izĩmum igbishuwa ananga ru umbi, umum ibvui iba ikũna umbi awe nggu umum, nu umbi asei ra anangkɛ umum iki iwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Anangkɛ umum iki izĩ umbi ahwɛngmbi utsĩndĩã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Utoma agɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, umɛn isi ihwɛngmɛn anangkɛ ungo iki izĩ. Umɛn ikorhu uguse ni ihwɛng utsĩndĩã?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwu utsĩndĩã, umum iwu idzidzɛrhe, ni iwu urhɛ. Unera asi ízĩã ru Utɛ, aba asi iwea ru ubokmum. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Umbi aba ahwɛngmbi umum, umbi awuri ihwɛngmbi Utɛmum. Utirhi icɛrɛ uzĩɔ̃ umbi aka ahwɛngmbi unga na anyãmbi unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Ufirhibu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, uma udɛyiwa umɛn Utɛ ha. Aka amɛ̃mɔnɔ ru umɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Aka adera umum iki iwu nggu umbi, bɔr utsɛku icɛrɛ ungo usi ihwɛngngo umum, Ufirhibu? Ubɛn uwuku unyã umum aka anyã Utɛ. Awu use utsu ungo ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;Udɛyiwa umɛn Utɛ ha&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Ungo usi iweɔ ri imangmang ugɛ umum iwu ru Utɛ, Utɛ awu ru umum? Arherhakɛ umum iki irherhuwa umbi asi iweke akimum. Awu Utɛ aka awe ru umum unga atɔ̃ itsernga. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Àka awe ru imangmang ra arherhamum iki igɔr ugɛ umum iwe ru Utɛ, Utɛ ikɛi awe ru umum, use aka awe ru imangmang ra abin idzeukɛ umum iki ikorhe. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, ubɛn uwuku uwe ri imangmang ru umum awuri ikikorhunga abinkɛ umum iki ikorhe. Awuri ikorha akɔɔ anangke akɛrɛ ha, ubinkutsu umum iwuri izĩ ru Utɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Nu ubin umbi aka ifɛna ri itsokmum, umum iwuri ikorhuwamum, ngge itsú Utɛ akpo ikpikpoi ru ubok Ungwɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Ubɛn ubina umbi aka ifɛna ri itsokmum, umum iwuri ikorhuwamum.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibemuwe ibiba Ipfu Isarsatangge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>&lt;&lt;Umbi aba abemumbi umum, umbi awuri ikorhumbi ubinkpi umum iki itsuka. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Umum iwuri irhusumum Utɛ, unga awuri idzaanga uwuku uyika umbi asei nggu umbi ugbagbaa. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Unga awu Ipfu iyi idzidzɛrhe, uwuruwi upfunga uku usi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ uyɛikpɔ unga, ubinkutsu upfunga usi idɛ̃ɛ̃ unyãkpɔ unga use uhwɛng unga. Bɔr umbi ahwɛngmbi unga, unga asei nggu umbi, ikɛi awuri iseisa ru umbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>Umum isi ínekamum umbi ru nyaka angwɛ̃rhãpfu. Umum iwuri iba ru umbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Ivanga ukunjiir upfunga usi íbvui unyãkpɔ umum, bɔr umbi awuri inyãmbi umum. Ubinkutsu umum iwemum ru urhɛ, umbi ikɛi awuri ibibɛkmbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Awu ru unum hã umbi aka ihwɛng ugɛ umum iwe ru Utɛmum nu umbi awe ru umum nu umum iwe ru umbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>Ubɛn unera uwuku uhwɛng arherhamum iki itsu na adɔsunga ake, awu unga abema umum. Uwuruwi aka abema umum, Utɛmum awuri ibemunga uner ha, umum ikɛi iwuri ibemumum uner ha ni idɛyiwe itsimum ru unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Mɔcɛ Uyahuda, asi iwea Uyahuda Uiskariyoti, agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, awu use utsu ungo iki idɛyiwa itsingo ru umɛn, bɔr ungo usi idɛyikɔ ru upfunga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn unera uwuku ubema umum awuri idɔsunga imesamum. Utɛmum awuri ibemunga uner ha, ikɛi umɛn iwuri inba iseimɛn nggu unga. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Ubɛn unera aka asi ibemunga umum asi ídɔsunga arherhe imesamum. Irhɛmyɛ umbi aka agũ isi iwengge irhɛmmum, awu irhɛm Utɛ uwuku udena umum.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>&lt;&lt;Kishoo akɛrɛ umum isɔmamum umbi umum iki ina iwu nggu umbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Bɔr uwuku uyika ha unga awuri imesuwa umbi abina kishoo na ayituwa umbi kishoo abinkɛ umum iki isɔma umbi. Unga awu Ipfu Isarsatangge, uwuruwi Utɛ aka idene ri itsokmum. <verse eid="JHN 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>Umum ĩbɔra umbi nggu ididɔɔr, ididɔɔrmum iki ĩdzaa umbi. Isi iwengge ru nyaku upfung iki idzowe. Niba aneke amɛnmbi agũke ighong, ikɛi niba agũmbi iwei.<verse eid="JHN 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>&lt;&lt;Umbi agũmbi umum iki ĩgɔr ugɛ, &lt;Umum izĩ ni ibvui ibamum ru umbi.&gt; Umbi aba abemumbi umum, umbi awuri igɔmmbi anggɔm ugɛ umum iwuri izĩ ru Utɛ, Utɛ ha ananga umum. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Icɛrɛ umum iki isɔmamum umbi ru ngge idɔrhi iwe, nggee ivangyɛ ngge iki iwe, umbi awe ru imangmang. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Umum isi íbvui irherhuwamum arherhe arhɛrhɛ, ubinkutsu uyɛrhe upfung ukpirɛ uwɔ abarɔ. Unga ashia ri ijee ri itsimum. <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>Bɔr awu ufang upfunga uhwɛng ugɛ umum ibemumum Utɛ ha ni ikorhe uku kpengkpeng ubinkpi Utɛmum aka atsuka umum.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">&lt;&lt;Àka asok icɛrɛ umɛn ibɔre nggimi.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu unga awu udzum ucucii inebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>&lt;&lt;Umum iwu udzum ucucii inebi uwu idzidzɛrhe, nu Utɛmum unga awu uner irhama. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Unga azharhuwe ubɛn uboka uku uwe ru umum uku usi ighwɛrkpɔ ikpũrhã, na agbishuwe ubɛn uboka ukpuku ughwɛr ikpũrhã, ru ukpɔ ughwɛr utoma. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Umbi aka awembi atɛtɛn ri itsi arherhamum iki isɔma umbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Àka asei ru umum, umum iwuri isei ru umbi. Ubok ucucii usi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ ughwɛrkpɔ ikpũrhã nibikakpɔ, awu ufang ukpɔ usei nggu udzuma. Rimi hã umbi asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ aghwɛrmbi ikpũrhã umbi aba asi iseimbi ru umum.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>&lt;&lt;Umum iwu udzuma, umbi awu aboka. Unera aba aseisa ru umum nu umum ikɛi isei ru unga, unga awuri ighwɛr ikpũrhã irhɛirhɛ. Umum ĩba ishimum ru umbi, umbi asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhumbi ubin. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Ubɛn unera aka asi iwea ru umum, awe ru nyaku ubokkpi umbɔ aka atare ukpɔ ukoyi. Anera aka isaka arheu ikpũ abok aki ha atsuku urha, akpĩĩwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Umbi aba asei ru umum arherhamum ikɛi aweke ru umbi, àka arhusa ubɛn ubinkpi umbi aka abee, awuri idzaambɔ umbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Umbi àka aghwɛr ikpũrhã irhɛirhɛ na adɛyiwe ugɛ umbi awu angwɛ̃ imesamum. Ngge ikũ nggaa ikpikpoi izĩ ru Utɛ.<verse eid="JHN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>&lt;&lt;Ru nyaku Utɛ aka abema umum, rimi hã umum iki ibema umbi. Icɛrɛ àka asei ri ibibemamum. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Umbi aba adɔsumbi arherhamum iki itsu, umbi awuri iseimbi ri ibibemamum, ru nyaka umum iki ĩdɔsa arherhe Utɛmum aka atsu ni isei ri ibibemanga. <verse eid="JHN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>Umum ĩdɛyiwa umbi riminɛ ngge itsú anggɔmmum awe ru umbi nu anggɔmmbi atsu atɔk. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Ikpemmum iyɛ, àka abema adɔka ru nyaka umum iki ĩbema umbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Nggaa ibibema iyɔɔ isi inangngge iyɛrɛ, ugɛ unera adzowe urhɛnga ri itsi awɛrhanga. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Umbi awu awɛrhamum, umbi aba akorhumbi ubinkpi umum iki itsuka umbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Umum isi íbvui iyisumum umbi agãrhã, ubinkutsu ugãrhã asi ihwɛngnga ubinkpi uteiyanga aki ikorhe. Bɔr umum iyisa umbi awɛrhɛ, ubinkutsu iki isɔmamum umbi kishoo abinkɛ umum iki igũ ru Utɛmum. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Asi iwea umbi asɛng umum, bɔr umum isɛng umbi itsuka umbi azĩ aghwɛr ikpũrhã, ikpũrhãyɛ iki idãrhã. Mɔcɛ Utɛ awuri idzaanga kishoo abinkɛ umbi aka arhusa ri itsokmum. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Ubinmum ukpi iki itsu, àka abema adɔka.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Upfunga ukpɛ̃kpɔ angwɛ̃ imesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>&lt;&lt;Upfunga uba ukpɛ̃kpɔ umbi, àka ahwɛng ra amɛnmbi ugɛ ugbaashia ukpɛ̃ umum. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Umbi aba awu abi upfung, upfunga uba ubemukpɔ umbi ru nyaka abinga. Bɔr umbi asi iwembi abi upfung. Umum iki isɛng umbi idzek ru upfunga. Ngge itsu upfung ukpɛ̃kpɔ umbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Àka ayita ubinkpi umum iki idɛyiwa umbi ugɛ, &lt;Ugãrhã asi inanga Uteiyanga.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13:16">Uyoh 13.16</ref></char>.</note> Umbɔ aba adzaa umum uver, awuri idzaambɔ umbi uver ikɛi. Umbɔ aba adɔsumbɔ imesamum, umbɔ awuri idɔsumbɔ iyimbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Awuri ikorhuwambɔ umbi akɛrɛ ha, ri itsi umbi awu abimum nu umbɔ asi ihwɛngmbɔ uwuku udena umum ĩba. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Agɛ umum isi ĩba irherhumum arherhe nggu umbɔ, umbɔ awuri ishimbɔ ru uvau arhim. Bɔr icɛrɛ umbɔ ashimbɔ ru ubin ukpuku ukaa atsimbɔ ra arhimmbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Unerwi aka akpɛ̃ umum, akpɛ̃ Utɛmum. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Agɛ umum isi ikorhumum abina arhɛrhɛ ru umbɔ akirakɛ unera aka anasi ikorhunga, mɔcɛ umbɔ awuri ishimbɔ ru uvau arhim. Bɔr icɛrɛ umbɔ aka anyãmbɔ abin idzeu ha na akpɛ̃mbɔ umum nu Utɛmum. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Akɛrɛ akorhe ngge itsuifɛr ubinkpi umbɔ aka atsɛng ri Íkpemmbɔ agɛ, &lt;Adzuma akpɛ̃mbɔ umum asi iwea ubin utsu.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Amb 35.19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69.4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>&lt;&lt;Ivangyɛ Uwuku Uyuyika ha aka iba, uwuruwi umum iki idene unga adzeku Utɛ aba ru umbi, Ipfu iyi idzidzɛrhe iki idzeku Utɛ, unga awuri idzowe ideka ri itsimum. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Umbi awuri iwu idekamum, ubinkutsu umbi awu nggu umum udzur ri inggbaashia.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>&lt;&lt;Umum isɔma umbi kishoo akɛrɛ utsur umbi ayapumbi ri imangmangmbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Awuri iwayikumbɔ umbi ra abã ifɛn-Num. Idzidzɛrhe, ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ ubɛn uwuku ufɛre umbi awuri igɔr ugɛ unga itɔ̃ itser Unum. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Umbɔ awuri ikorhe rimi ubinkutsu umbɔ anasi ihwɛngmbɔ Utɛ use umum. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Umum isɔma umbi akɛrɛ, nggee ivang hã iba iwengge umbi ayita ugɛ umum iki isɔmamum umbi. Umum isi isɔmamum umbi abin akɛrɛ ri inggbaashia ubinkutsu, umum ina iwu nggu umbi.<verse eid="JHN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itser Ipfu Isarsatangge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>&lt;&lt;Icɛrɛ umum iwuri izĩ ru uwuku udena umum iba, bɔr umbi asi irhusumbi umum ugɛ, &lt;Ungo uwuri izĩnɛ?&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Amɛnmbi aghong ra abin hã umum iki isɔma umbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Bɔr umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, awu azeze ru umbi umum ĩba izĩmum. Umum ĩba isi izĩmum, mɔcɛ Uwuku Uyuyika ha asi íbanga ru umbi. Bɔr umum ĩba izĩmum, umum iwuri idene unga aba ru umbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka iba, unga awuri idɛyiwe upfunga uvau arhim nu irhirhika nu ivarha arherhe. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Unga awuri idɛyiwe umbɔ ugɛ umbɔ awe ra arhim, ubinkutsu anera ashimbɔ ri imangmang ru umum. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Unga awuri idɛyiwe igbigbambɔ ri irhirhika, ubinkutsu umum iwuri izĩ ru Utɛ, umbi asi íbvui anyãmbi umum. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Unga awuri idɛyiwe umbɔ agɛ awuri izharha arherhambɔ, ubinkutsu uyɛrhe upfung ukpirɛ aka atsukukumbɔ unga uvau.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>&lt;&lt;Umum ibɔr abina arhɛrhɛ umum iki irherhuwa umbi, akirakɛ umbi asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ anyangumbi ake icɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Bɔr ivangyɛ Ipfu iyi idzidzɛrhe ha iki iba, ngge iwuri idarh umbi ri idzidzɛrhe kishoo. Asi íwea arherhe itsikamnga unga aka irherhe, bɔr awuri isɔma ubinkpi unga aka agũ. Awuri isɔma umbi abinkɛ aka iwuri iba. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Awuri ikũ ikpikpoi aba ru umum, unga awuri inyãnga abinkɛ umum iki irherhe adɛyiwa umbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Kishoo abinkɛ Utɛ aka awe ra ake awu akimum. Ngge itsu umum igɔr ugɛ Ipfu-Num ha iwuri inyãnga abinkɛ umum iki irherhe adɛyiwa umbi.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igũ ighong iwuri idzipa iwu igũibɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>&lt;&lt;Ivanga ukunjiir umbi asi ínyãmbi umum, mɔcɛ ikɛi ivanga ukunjiir umbi awuri inyãmbi umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga abɔɔ agɔr adɔkambɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Agbena agburh use unga aka agɔr umɛn agɛ, &lt;Ivanga ukunjiir umbi asi ínyãmbi umum, mɔcɛ ikɛi ivanga ukunjiir umbi awuri inyãmbi umum,&gt; nu &lt;Ubinkutsu umum iwuri izĩ ru Utɛ&gt;?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Adɛ̃ɛ̃mbɔ irhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Agbena awu use unga aka agɔr agɛ, &lt;Ivanga ukunjiir&gt;? Umɛn isi ihwɛngmɛn agben ubinkpi unga aka arherhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Uyesu anyã umbɔ abee irhusa unga ra arherhe ha, nggee unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi arhusa adɔka agben arherha ha umum iki igɔr ugɛ, &lt;Ivanga ukunjiir umbi asi ínyãmbi umum, mɔcɛ ikɛi ivanga ukunjiir umbi awuri inyãmbi umum&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, umbi awuri iciu akpe nggu ighongamɛn, bɔr upfunga uwuri igɔmanggɔm. Amɛnmbi awuri ida, bɔr ida amɛnmbi iwuri idzipa iwu anggɔm. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Ivangyɛ ukutsɛrh aba ahwashi imar, unga aka isaka agũ ighong akarhãrhã, ubinkutsu ivang imarnga iki iwengge. Bɔr ivangyɛ unga aka imar irheng ungwɛ̃ amaa, unga aka isaka ayiruka ighighong hã, ubinkutsu unga awu ra anggɔm unga aka amar irheng ungwɛ̃ ru upfunga. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Ngge iwu rimi hã ru umbi. Icɛrɛ umbi awuri igũ ighong, bɔr umum ibvui inyãmum umbi, mɔcɛ amɛnmbi aka igɔmanggɔm, unera asi ívura anggɔmmbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>Ru unum hã umbi asi írhusumbi umum ubin. Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, Utɛ awuri idzaanga kishoo ubinkpi umbi aka arhusa ri itsokmum. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Utsɛku icɛrɛ umbi anasi irhusumbi ubin ri itsokmum. Àka arhusa umbi awuri iyiyɛimbi, nu anggɔmmbi awuri itsu atɔke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Umum inangmum upfunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>&lt;&lt;Umum ikũ nyaka arherhe indɛyiwa umbi akɛrɛ ha. Bɔr ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ umum iki irherha arherhe nggu umbi ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ ri itsi Utɛ, umum isi iwuri íkũmum nyaka arherhe. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Ru unum hã umbi awuri irhusa ri itsokmum. Umum isi igɔrmum ugɛ iwuri irhusuwamum Utɛ ru umbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Unga Utɛ nibikanga abemunga umbi, ubinkutsu umbi abemumbi umum, ikɛi umbi awembi ri imangmang ugɛ umum idzeku Unum. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Umum idzeku Utɛ iba itsĩ ru upfung, icɛrɛ umum iwuri ibɔre upfung ni ibvui izĩ ru Utɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Mɔcɛ angwɛ̃ imesu Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩhĩĩ! Awu icɛrɛ ungo uku urherhuwa umɛn arherhe ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ asi iweke unyaka arherhe! <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Icɛrɛ umɛn iki ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ ungo uhwɛngo abina kishoo. Ungo uhwɛngo ubɛn ubinkpi unera aka irhusa ungo. Akɛrɛ ha atsu umɛn iwe ru imangmang ugɛ ungo udzeku Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu icɛrɛ umbi aka awe ri imangmang? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Bɔr ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ, iki ibangge, ubɛn unera ru umbi awuri itĩ azĩ ri iyanga na aneka umum ikiyikamum. Bɔr rimi hã, umum isi iwemum ikiyikami, ubinkutsu Utɛ awu nggu umum.<verse eid="JHN 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>&lt;&lt;Umum isɔmamum umbi abin akɛrɛ, ngge itsú umbi ama akpo ididɔɔr. Ru upfung ukpirɛ umbi awuri igũ ighong. Bɔr àka aker amɛn! Umum iki inangmum upfunga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu afɛn-Num ri itsinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Uyesu aka amaa irherhe abin akɛrɛ, unga abera asunga arhi afã na afɛn-Num agɛ,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="JHN 17:1">&lt;&lt;A Utɛ, ivanga iki iwengge. Ukpoi Ungwɛ̃ngo nggee Ungwɛ̃ngo ama akpoi ungo. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Ubinkutsu ungo uku udzowukɔ Ungwɛ̃ngo ijee ri itsi anera kishoo, nggee unga ama adzowe urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa ru kishoo abirabɛ ungo uku udzowe unga. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Uwɛrɛ ha awu urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa, ugɛ umbɔ ama ahwɛng ungo, Unum unying ukpekũ, nu Uyesu Ukiristo, uwuruwi ungo uku udene. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Umum ikũwã ungo ukpoi ra abĩ ni imaawe itsera kishoo ungo uku udzaa umum itɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Icɛrɛ ikɛi, a Utɛ, ukpoi umum ra asungo nggu ikpikpoi ha umum iki iwurangge nggu ungo, ru upfung udɔrhu umuna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu afɛne-Num ra angwɛ̃ imesanga</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>&lt;&lt;Umum iki idɛyikũ ungo ra anerabɛ ungo uku udzaa umum ru upfung. Umbɔ awu abingo, ungo adzaa umbɔ ru umum, umbɔ ikɛi aka adɔsumbɔ arherhango. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Icɛrɛ umbɔ ahwɛngmbɔ kishoo abinkɛ ungo uku udzaa umum adzeku ungo, <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>ubinkutsu iki idzowukũ ru umbɔ arherhango uku udzaa umum. Umbɔ aka ayɛimbɔ ake na ahwɛngmbɔ ugɛ awu idzidzɛrhe umum idzeku ungo, na awembɔ ri imangmang ugɛ awu ungo udena umum. <verse eid="JHN 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>Umum ifɛne-Num ru umbɔ. Umum isi inumum ifɛne-Num ru upfunga, bɔr umum ifɛne-Num ra abirabɛ ungo uku udzaa umum, ubinkutsu umbɔ awu abingo. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Kishoo abinmum awu akingo, nu kishoo abinngo awu akimum. Ikpikpoi iki ibangge ru umum ru ubokmbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Umum isi íbvui iseisũ ru upfunga, bɔr umbɔ ana awu ru upfunga kata. Umum ibvui iba ru ungo. Usarkasar Utɛ, ukũ ijee itsokngo ukake umbɔ, itsokyɛ ungo uku udzaa umum, ngge itsú umbɔ awu unying ru nyaka umɛn iki iwu unying. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Ivangyɛ umum iki iwu nggu umbɔ, umum ikũ ijee itsokyɛ ungo uku udzaa umum ikake umbɔ. Uwɔɔ asi igwira, unying hã ukpekũ aka awu uwuku utsutsĩm, ngge itsuifɛr itsɛng Arherhu-Num.<verse eid="JHN 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>&lt;&lt;Icɛrɛ umum iwuri iba ru ungo, bɔr umum irherha abina akɛrɛ ru umum ina iwu ru upfung, ngge itsú umbɔ ama akpo undzumu anggɔmmum ra amɛnmbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Umum iki isɔmukũ arherhango ru umbɔ, upfunga ikɛi uku ukpɛ̃kpɔ umbɔ, ubinkutsu umbɔ asi iwembɔ abi upfung ru nyaka umum iki isi iwemum uwu upfung. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Isi irhusumum ungo unyanguwe umbɔ ru upfunga, bɔr ungo udzɛu umbɔ ru ubok Undenggũ. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Umbɔ asi iwembɔ abi upfung, ru nyaka umum iki isi iwemum uwu upfung. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Utsu umbɔ awu asarkasar ri idzidzɛrhe. Arherhango awu idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Umum idene umbɔ azĩ ru upfung, ru nyaka ungo uku udena umum ru upfunga. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Umum idzowe itsimum ri itsimbɔ, nggee umbɔ ama adzowe atsimbɔ ru ungo ru ubok idzidzɛrhe.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu afɛne-Num ru kishoo <optbreak/> abi imangmang</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>&lt;&lt;Ifɛn-Nummum isi iwengge ru umbɔ ikiyikambɔ. Bɔr a Utɛ, umum ifɛne-Num ra abirabɛ aka awuri iwe ri imangmang ru umum ru ubok arherhambɔ, <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>ugɛ umbɔ kishoo ama awu unying. Umbɔ ama awe ru umɛn, ru nyaka ungo uku uwe ru umum, nu umum iwe ru ungo, ngge itsú anera ru upfung awe ru imangmang ugɛ awu ungo udena umum ĩba. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Umum iki idzowukũ umbɔ ikpikpoiyɛ ungo uku udzaa umum, ru umbɔ awu unying ru nyaka umɛn iki iwu unying. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Umum isei ru umbɔ nu ungo ru umum. Umbɔ ama awu unying, ru upfunga uma uhwɛng ugɛ awu ungo udena umum ĩba, na ahwɛng ugɛ ungo ubemungo umbɔ ru nyaka ungo uku ubema umum.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>&lt;&lt;A Utɛ, anerabɛ ungo uku udzaa umum, umum ibee umbɔ asei nggu umum ra anangkɛ umum iki iwe, na anyã ikpikpoimum, iyiriyɛ ungo uku udzaa umum, ubinkutsu ungo uku ubemungo umum umbɔ adɔrha amunu upfunga.<verse eid="JHN 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>&lt;&lt;A Utɛ uwuku urhurhika, upfunga usi ihwɛngkpɔ ungo, bɔr umum ihwɛngmum ungo, anera ikɛi ahwɛngmbɔ ugɛ awu ungo udena umum iba. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Umum iki idɛyikũ ungo ru umbɔ. Ikɛi umum ina itsu umbɔ ahwɛng ungo ubɛn ivang, nggee ibibemango uku ukorhuwa umum ima isei ru umbɔ nu umum isei ru umbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Aka adzurmbɔ Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Umat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Umar 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Irh 22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka amaa ifɛn-Num, Uyesu agar izɛ̃rhĩ Ukidron azĩã ugar ukpɔrɔ nggu angwɛ̃ imesanga. Ugar ha icang acucii uzaitun niyɔ, unga nu angwɛ̃ imesanga atsĩmbɔ ru ngge.<verse eid="JHN 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Uyahuda, ungwɛ̃ imesa uwuku ugha adak Uyesu, ahwɛnga anang hã, ubinkutsu Uyesu aka isaka agbowa umɔ nggu angwɛ̃ imesanga. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Nggee Uyahuda akũ ukpui abi iwa nu adogerhi abɔɔ abi ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num, nu abi Ufarisi, azĩmbɔ ri icang acucii uzaitun hã. Umbɔ akpɔm nggu atseu irhirhang nú atɔngvi akagɔng nu abin iwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Uyesu aka ahwɛnga kishoo ubinkpi uku ikpo unga. Unga adzeka, aba agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi abee ungamɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyesu uner Unazarat.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum uwi.&gt;&gt; Uyahuda, uwuku ughadaknga, adɛ̃ɛ̃ umɔ nggu umbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Uyesu aka agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwe uwu ha,&gt;&gt; umbɔ azĩmbɔ ra andzing na agba ra abĩ.<verse eid="JHN 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Uyesu abvui arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi abee ungamɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyesu uner Unazarat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iki idɛyiwamum umbi ugɛ umum iwu unga. Umbi aba ani ibeea umum, mɔcɛ àka neke anera abɛrɛ azĩmbɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Akɛrɛ akorhe nggee arherhakɛ Uyesu aka arherhe atsuafɛr. Unga aka agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ra aner ha ungo uku udzaa umum unera ru umbɔ asi igwira.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">Uyoh 6.39</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Usiman Ubitru awe ru ikon iki ider, awɔɔr ike agbɛr uto ubok ugha ugãrhũ Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num, azharhuwe. Itsok ugãrhã hã igburh Umarhcu.<verse eid="JHN 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Bɔr Uyesu agɔr Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsuke ikon iki iderngo ru udapa! Umum isi íhwamum ru ukpɛwawi Utɛ aka adzaa umum ihwa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ra asu Uhanana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Umat 26.57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Umar 14.53-54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Irh 22.54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Mɔcɛ ukpui abi iwa nu unggbaashimbɔ, nu adogerhi abi Uyahuda adzur Uyesu, abow unga. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Ri inggbaashia umbɔ akũ unga azĩ ru Uhanana, unga aka awu umar Ukayafa. Ukayafa unga awu Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num ra amɛk ha. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Ukayafa unga adzowe anggbaashi abi Uyahuda itsũwã ugɛ ugba unera unying akpe ri itsi anera arhɛrhɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubitru atsɛyinga ihwɛng Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Umat 26.69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Umar 14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Irh 22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Usiman Ubitru nggu uwɔɔ ra awɛ imesu Uyesu adɔsu Uyesu ra andzing. Ungwɛ̃ imesa ha, Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num ahwɛnga unga, nggee unga atsĩã ru ufɔm iya Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num nggu Uyesu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Bɔr Ubitru adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra angwĩã udika awiya. Ungwɛ̃ imesa ha, Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num hã aka ahwɛng adzek arherha arherhe nggu una uwuku udzɛu angwĩ ubã, na akũ Ubitru atsĩ.<verse eid="JHN 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Una uwuku udzɛu angwĩ ubã hã agɔr Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo igango usi iweɔ unying ra angwɛ̃ imesanga?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ, umum ishimum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Awu ri ivang ighɛnga ngge itsu agãrhã nu adogerhi atai urha, adɛ̃ɛ̃ iwɛr urha. Ubitru adɛ̃ɛ̃ iwɛr urha ha nggu umbɔ.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num <optbreak/> arhusu Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Umat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Umar 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Irh 22.66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Mɔcɛ Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num arhusu Uyesu ri itsi angwɛ̃ imesanga nu imesanga.<verse eid="JHN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum irherha arherhe ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu upfunga. Ubɛn ivang umum imesuwe ra abã ifɛn-Num nu Iya-Num, anangkɛ abi Uyahuda iki ikɔng kishoo. Umum inasi irherhumum ubin ukpɔɔ ri iwɔk. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Awu use utsu ungo urhusa umum? Urhusa abika agosha arherhamum ubinkpi umum iki idɛyiwe umbɔ. Umbɔ ahwɛngmbɔ ubinkpi umum iki irherhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Ivang Uyesu aka arherhe rimi, uwɔɔ ru umbɔ adogerhi ha aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ umɔ akwɛr unga na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Rimi ungo uku irherhe nggu Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iba igbigba umum iki irherhe rimi hã, udɛyiwa igbigbamum. Bɔr umum iba irherhe idzidzɛrhe, awu use utsu ungo ukwɛr umum?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Mɔcɛ Uhanana atsu umbɔ akũ Uyesu azĩmbɔ ru Ukayafa, Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num. Unga ana awu ri ibibow.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubitru abvui atsɛyinga ihwɛng Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Umat 26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Umar 14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Irh 22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Ubitru ana adɛ̃ɛ̃ iwɛr urha ha, abɔɔ aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ umɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo usi iweɔ unying ra angwɛ̃ imesanga hã?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Ubitru atsɛyinga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ishimum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Ugãrhũ uwɔɔ ra agãrhã Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num awu umɔ. Utsa ha awu unang uwuruwi Ubitru aka azharhuwe utoa, unga agɔr Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea ungo umum iki inyã nggu unga ru icang acucii uzaitun?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Ubitru abvui atsɛyi. Kanying ikɔ igbɛr ukpee.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ra asu ugomna Ubirhatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Umat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Umar 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Irh 23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Mɔcɛ abi Uyahuda akũ Uyesu adzek ri iya Ukayafa azĩmbɔ udzepurhe ugomna Uroma. Aka awu ukpee. Abi Uyahuda akpɛ̃mbɔ itsĩ ru udzepurhea, agɛ utsur umbɔ asi isarmbɔ ra agbeyakɛ aka ikɛn umbɔ igha Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Nggee Ubirhatu adzek aba arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Arherhe akasong umbi aka atsu ri itsi utsak uwurɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Agɛ unga ashia ru uvau, umɛn isi íkũ unga ibamɛn ru ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Ubirhatu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka akũna unga azĩ atsuke unga uvau nibikambi ri Íkpemmbi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Anggbaashi abi Uyahuda asi ibeembɔ na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Bɔr isi irhikungge umɛn itsu ufai akpe ru ubɛn uner.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Akɛrɛ akorhe ngge itsuifɛr arherhe Uyesu aka arherhe aki ikpũ akpenga aka ikpe.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Ubirhatu abvui atsĩã ru udzepurhe ha, unga ayisu Uyesu arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu Uyɛrhe abi Uyahuda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɛrɛ awu ungo urhusa use anera adɛyiwa ungo ri itsimum?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Ubirhatu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwu uner abi Uyahuda? Awu abi abĩmbi nu ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num umbɔ atsuka ungo ru ubokmum. Ungo ukorhu use?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Iyɛrhamum isi iwengge iyi upfung ukpirɛ. Agɛ Iyɛrhamum iwu iyi upfung ukpirɛ, agãrhãmum awuri ikɛnmbɔ anggbaashi abi Uyahuda idzur umum. Bɔr Iyɛrhamum iwu iyi anang akase.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Ubirhatu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu uyɛrhe nukpɔ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo urherhe mɔnɔ ungo uku ugɔr ugɛ umum iwu uyɛrhe. Ngge itsu umbɔ amar umum, ikɛi ngge itsu umum itsĩwã ru upfung, indzowe ideka ri itsi idzidzɛrhe. Ubɛn uwuku uwe ri idzidzɛrhe awuri ikpea ato na adɔsunga urhɛmmum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Ubirhatu arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use uwu idzidzɛrhe?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Atsu ufai akpe ru Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Umat 27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Umar 15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Irh 23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Ubirhatu aka arherha akɛrɛ amaa, unga abvui adzek agɔr abi Uyahuda agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum isi ikpomum unga nggu uvau.<verse eid="JHN 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr umbi awembi ru ugau, ri ivang Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng umum iki isaki itsũwã umbi uner uvau unying ru ugborzĩ. Umbi abeembi umum itsũwã Uyɛrhe abi Uyahuda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Umbɔ abvui atsui ivum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ! Asi iwea uwɛrɛ ungo iki itsũwã, utsũwã Ubaraba!&gt;&gt; Ubaraba uner uwuku utsu anera asoyiwe amɛn abika akpɔm abĩã.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Ufai ukpuku unyapuwe Uyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Mɔcɛ Ubirhatu atsu umbɔ akwɛre ugwɛɛ ru Uyesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Abi iwa akũ ídidɔk akari ifur atsime ni itsi Uyesu. Umbɔ atsime unga atorho iyɛrhe. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Aba ru unga, anu ikwɛr unga na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Urhɛngo uder, Uyɛrhe abi Uyahuda!&gt;&gt; Mɔcɛ umbɔ akwɛr unga nú unyɛ̃ɛ̃nga.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Ubirhatu abvui adzek aba agɔr abi Uyahuda agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka anyã, umum iwuri ikũna unga idzeka ru umbi ahwɛng umum isi ikpomum unga nggu uvau.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Ivang Uyesu aka adzeka nggu ifur ididɔk ni itsinga na atsim atorho iyɛrhe, Ubirhatu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka anyã utsa ha uwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Ivang ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num nu adogerhi Iya-Num aka anyã Uyesu, umbɔ atsu ivum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Anyapuwe unga! Anyapuwe unga!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Bɔr Ubirhatu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka azĩ anyapuwe unga nibikambi. Umum isi ikpomum unga nggu uvau.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Anggbaashi abi Uyahuda angipa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn iwemɛn ri ikpem, ikpem hã igɔr igɛ awu ufang unga akpe, ubinkutsu anyangi itsinga awu Ungwɛ̃ Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Ivang Ubirhatu aka agũ rimi, iwei itomi ifɛr unga. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Unga abvui atsĩã ru udzepurhe ha, arhusu Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo udzekɛ?&gt;&gt; Bɔr Uyesu asi idzipunga urhɛm. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Ubirhatu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo ukpɛ̃ɔ irherha arherhe nggu umum? Ungo usi ihwɛngngo ugɛ umum iwemum ri ijee iyiki itsũwã ungo use umum inyapuwe ungo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo ushiɔ ri ijee ri itsimum, ngge iba isi idzengge ru Unum. Nggee unerwi aka atsuka umum ru ubokngo awe ra arhim ananga ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Udzur na arherhe akɛrɛ, Ubirhatu abee itsũwe Uyesu, bɔr anggbaashi abi Uyahuda atsarhi irhakmbɔ atsu ivum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uba utsũwũkɔ unga, ungo usi iweɔ uwɛrhu Ukaisar. Ubɛn uwuku ugɔr ugɛ unga awu uyɛrhe, unga uwu unggamtsak Ukaisar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Ivang Ubirhatu aka agũ ubin umbɔ aka arherhe, unga akũ Uyesu adzeka na asei nú utarh ukpuku utsu uvau, ra anang hã umbɔ aki isaka ayisa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubeu Atarh&gt;&gt;. Ri idũ abi Uyahuda umbɔ iki iyisa Ugabbata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Aka awu atenum ru unum ukpuku ugbisha abin Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">Ubirhatu agɔr abi Uyahuda agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyɛrhambi uwi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Bɔr abi Uyahuda atsui ivum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Akũna unga adzek! Akũna unga adzek! Anyapuwe unga!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Ubirhatu arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi abee umum inyapuwe uyɛrhambi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn ishimɛn ru uyɛrhe uwɔɔ. Ukaisar ukpekũ awu uyɛrhamɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Mɔcɛ Ubirhatu atsukuka unga ru ubok abi Uyahuda umbɔ anyapuwe unga. Nggee abi iwa akũ Uyesu azĩmbɔ.<verse eid="JHN 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyapuwe Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Umat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Umar 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Irh 23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Uyesu atsã igãrhãmau ucuciianga nibikanga adzek utepa akũ azĩ anang akɔɔ umbɔ iki iyisa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Anang Apfupfu Aghow Itsi.&gt;&gt; Ri idũ abi Uyahuda ayisa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ugorhgota.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Umɔ umbɔ anyapuwe unga nggu inera ivaa, unying ru ubok ughanga, unying ikɛi ru ubok uferanga nu Uyesu ra ateumbɔ.<verse eid="JHN 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Ubirhatu atsɛng isarhe, umbɔ anyapuwe nú igãrhãmau ucuciia ha. Unga atsɛng agɛ, <char style="sc">&lt;&lt;UYESU UNER UNAZARAT, UYƐRHA ABI UYAHUDA.&gt;&gt; </char> <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Abi Uyahuda arhɛrhɛ aka avarhe isarhe ha, ubinkutsu anangkɛ umbɔ aka anyapuwe Uyesu akhapa ru utepa. Itsɛng hã umbɔ atsɛng ngge ri idũ abi Uyahuda nu iyi abi Uroma nu abi Uherhini. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num abi Uyahuda asi ibemumbɔ ubinkpi Ubirhatu aka atsɛng agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba utsɛ̃ngo, &lt;Uyɛrha abi Uyahuda,&gt; bɔr utsɛng ugɛ utsak uwurɛ agɔr agɛ unga awu uyɛrha abi Uyahuda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Ubirhatu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubinkpi umum iki itsɛng, iki itsɛng ukpɔ nukpɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Abi iwa aka anyapuwe Uyesu amaa, umbɔ unyangu atorhanga, agasha agapa anaa, ubɛn unera anyangu ugapa unying, na atorha aki unɔrkang abɔrke. Aki ha asi isɔrmbɔ bɔr anunu ake udzur afafã uba ra abĩã.<verse eid="JHN 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Umbɔ agɔr adɔka agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn niba ivarkumɛn atorha akɛrɛ, bɔr umɛn itang isɛng ra ake ni inyãni uwuruwi aka igha.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Akɛrɛ akorhe rimi ngge itsuifɛr ubinkpi uku utsɛng ra Arherhu-Num ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">&lt;&lt;Agasha atorhamum ra adɔkambɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">atorhamum ikɛi umbɔ atang isɛng ri itsike.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Amb 22.18</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ubinkpi abi iwa aka akorhe nukpɔ.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Abirabɛ aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ akhapa ru igãrhãmau ucucii Uyesu awu umbɔ uyanga nggu unapumbɔ, nu Umaryamu utsɛrha Ukirhoba, nu Umaryamu Umagadarha. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Uyesu aka anyã uyanga nu ungwɛ̃ imesa ha unga aka abema adɛ̃ɛ̃ akhapa umɔ, unga agɔr uyanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A uze utsɛrh ha, uwɛrɛ awu ungwɛ̃ngo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr ungwɛ̃ imesa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uwɛrɛ unga awu uyango.&gt;&gt; Udzur ri ivang hã, ungwɛ̃ imesa ha akũ uyisa Uyesu azĩã aseisa nggu unga ri iyanga.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpe Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Umat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Umar 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Irh 23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Uyesu aka ahwɛnga agɛ abina kishoo aka amaake, nu ngge itsuifɛr ubinkpi uku utsɛng ra Arherhu-Num, unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ugɔ̃ amɛ̃ ufɛr umum.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Itseu niyɔ itɔk nggu amɛ̃ inebi akika agbata idɛ̃ɛ̃ umɔ. Umbɔ abii usoso ra ake, anyangu iyɛk iyiki ider avak usoso ha na abere akũ azĩ ra angwĩ Uyesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Ivang Uyesu aka ayɛi amɛ̃ inebi akika agbata amaa, unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Iki imaangge!&gt;&gt; Mɔcɛ unga arhɛrhi itsinga atsũwũka ipfunga.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akũ asawa atar Uyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Mɔcɛ anggbaashi abi Uyahuda ashɔ̃rhũ Ubirhatu unga atsu umbɔ abvũĩwe adak abirabɛ umbɔ aka anyapuwe na acipuwe ayormbɔ ru igãrhãmau acuciia ha. Akorhe rimi ubinkutsu awu unum ukpuku ugbisha abin unum ukpuku uwosha, umbɔ asi ibeembɔ ayor anyapa ri igãrhãmau acucii ru unum ukpuku uwosha. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Abi iwa aba ru umbɔ ha umbɔ aka anyapuwe nggu Uyesu abvũĩwe adak uner uwu inggbaashia, na azĩ abvũĩwe adak uner uwu uvaa ha. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Bɔr umbɔ aka aba ru Uyesu, umbɔ anyã unga aka akpea, nggee umbɔ asi ibvũĩkumbɔ adaknga. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Bɔr unying ra abi iwa ha akũ asawa atar Uyesu ri igbɔmnga, kanying adzirh nu amɛ̃ adzek.<verse eid="JHN 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Uner uwuku unyã abin hã kishoo aka akorhe, unga adzowuka ideka. Idekayɛ unga aka arherhe iwu idzidzɛrhe. Unga nibikanga ahwɛnga ugɛ unga arherhe idzidzɛrhe. Unga arherha akɛrɛ nggee umbi ikɛi ama awe ru imangmang. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Akɛrɛ akorhe ru ubinkpi umbɔ aka atsɛng ra Arherhu-Num atsuafɛr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Upfupfunga unying umbɔ asi ibvũĩkumbɔ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Idzi 12.46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Uva 9.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Amb 34.20</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num ikɛi igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Awuri irhimbɔ uwuruwi umbɔ aka atar.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Uzak 12.10</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igwirhuwe Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Umat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Umar 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Irh 23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Akɛrɛ aka atɔng Uyusuf uner Uarimatiya, uwuruwi aka awu ungwɛ̃ imesu Uyesu, ashɔ̃rhũ Ubirhatu unga adzowe ijeea unga ashupu iyor Uyesu. Bɔr unga akorha akɛrɛ ri iwɔk ubinkutsu unga agũ iwei anggbaashi abi Uyahuda. Ubirhatu abemuka, nggee unga azĩ ashupu iyor Uyesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Unikodimu, uner ha aka aba ru Uyesu ru untsuuka, azĩã nggu Uyusuf. Unga akpɔm nggu atsei umbɔ iki iyisa umur aka akayi nggu uarho ake aka awe akirhograma isɔka itaar. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Umbɔ ikivarhambɔ ashupu ukom iyor Uyesu, asakuwe abin isung hã ri iyornga na akũ atorho abɛrh ukpɔ. Akɛrɛ awu ugau idza uner abi Uyahuda. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Ra anangkɛ umbɔ aka anyapuwe unga, icang irham niyɔ iwu umɔ. Ru icang hã utai uku ufa ru ukpɔ umbɔ aki ingwɛ̃we ukom umɔ. Anasi ingwɛ̃mbɔ ukom umɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Ngge iki iwu unum abi Uyahuda aki igbisha abin unum ukpuku uwosha nu utai ha ukhapa umɔ, umbɔ adzakukumbɔ iyor Uyesu umɔ.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Isisok Uyesu ra akpe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Umat 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Umar 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Irh 24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Ri igɔ̃kpeka ru unum ukpu inggbaashia ri inuma utɔɔva, ukpe una usi isarkpɔ, Umaryamu Umagadarha azĩã ru utai ha, anyã utarh ukpuku utsim ra angwĩ utai ha uku ugɔ̃rhũkpɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Nggee unga atĩ azĩã ru Ubitru nu ungwɛ̃ imesa uwuruwi Uyesu aka abema, agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Aka atsũwũkumbɔ Uteijee ru udzaka! Umɛn isi ihwɛngmɛn anangkɛ umbɔ aka angwɛ̃we unga!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Nggee umbɔ Ubitru nu angwɛ̃ imesa ha adzek azĩmbɔ ru utai ha. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Ikivarhambɔ atĩtser, bɔr ungwɛ̃ imesa uwɔrɔ afaru Ubitru atɔnga, agbaashia azĩ atsĩã ra anang utai ha. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Unga agbapfu arhi anyã atorho hã aka anu, bɔr unga asi itsĩa ru utai ha. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Mɔcɛ Ubitru aba ra andzingnga, atsĩã ru utai ha na anyã atorho ha aka anu umɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>Ikɛi anyã atorhakɛ umbɔ aka abope ni itsi Uyesu. Aka afeta anu ra anang akɔɔ awuweke nggu anang atorha ha. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Mɔcɛ ungwɛ̃ imesa uwɔɔ uwuku uggbaashia azĩ atsĩ ra anang utai ha, atsĩã ru utai ha. Ivangyɛ unga aka anyã, unga awe ru imangmang. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Bɔr ri ivang hã umbɔ anasi ihwɛngmbɔ itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr igɛ awu ufang Uyesu awuri isoka ra akpe.<verse eid="JHN 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Mɔcɛ angwɛ̃ imesa ha abvui azĩmbɔ ra ayambɔ.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu adzeka ru Umaryamu Umagadarha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Umat 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Umar 16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Bɔr Umaryamu adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra awiya utai ha na aciu akpe. Adɛ̃ɛ̃ iciu akpe ha nukpi, unga agbapfu na arhi ru utai ha. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>Unga anyã ípfu itser-Num ivaa nggu atorho aka aterha asei ra anangkɛ ukom iyor Uyesu uku unu bɔr ushikpɔ umɔ. Ipfu itser-Num hã unying isei udiki itsia, iyi ivaa isei udika adaknga.<verse eid="JHN 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Ípfu itser-Num hã irhusa unga igɛ, &lt;&lt;A utsɛrh ha, ungo uciu usengu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Aka ashipukumbɔ iyor Uteijeemum, umum isi ihwɛng anangkɛ umbɔ aka akũna unga azĩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Unga aka amaa irherha arherha ha, unga adzipa anyã Uyesu aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ umɔ bɔr unga asi ihwɛngnga ugɛ awu Uyesu.<verse eid="JHN 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Uyesu arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A utsɛrh ha, ungo uciu usengo? Ungo uni ubee ungamɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Unga akaifɛrhkɔ agɛ use awu uner itser icang hã, nggee unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A uteiya, aba awu ungo ushupa unga, ungo udɛyiwa anangkɛ ungo uku ungwɛ̃we unga nu umum izĩ ishupa unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umaryamu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Unga adzipa azĩ udiku Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Urabboni!&gt;&gt; Ri idũ abi Uyahuda agbena agburh, &lt;&lt;A umarhem.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba ukpɔmɔ umum, ubinkutsu umum inasi izĩmum ru Utɛ kata. Bɔr uzĩ ra angwɛ̃mɛn ugɔr umbɔ ugɛ, &lt;Umum ibvui izĩ ru Utɛmum nu Utɛmbi, izĩ ru Unummum nu Unummbi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Umaryamu Umagadarha azĩ nggu isarhe ha, agɔr angwɛ̃ imesa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum inyãmum Uteijee!&gt;&gt; Unga adɛyiwe umbɔ ubinkpi Uyesu aka adɛyiwe unga.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu adzeka ra angwɛ̃ imesanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Umat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Umar 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Irh 24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Urhɛɛ uku uwe ru unum ukpu inggbaashia ri inuma utɔɔva, angwɛ̃ imesa Uyesu akɔng ananga unying. Iwei anggbaashi abi Uyahuda itsu umbɔ agbange angwĩ ubã kishoo. Uyesu aba adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra ateumbɔ na agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ididɔɔr ima iwe nggu umbi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Unga aka arherhe rimi amaa, mɔcɛ unga adɛyiwe aboknga nu igbɔmnga. Angwɛ̃ imesa ha agɔm anggɔm umbɔ aka anyã Uteijee.<verse eid="JHN 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Uyesu abvui agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ididɔɔr ima iwe nggu umbi! Ru nyaku Utɛ aka adena umum, rimi hã umum ini idena umbi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Unga aka arherhe rimi amaa, mɔcɛ unga afɛte uwoianga ru umbɔ, agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka ayɛi Ipfu Isarsatangge. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Ubɛn unera umbi aka atsũwe arhimnga, aka atsũwũkumbɔ ake nukpɔ. Ubɛn unera umbi aka asi itsũwũkumbi, asi itsũwũkumbɔ nukpɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu adzeka ru Utoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Utoma, uwuruwi umbɔ iki iyisa Akãrhghwɛ̃, unying ru umbɔ usɔkdũmɛn hã, ashia umɔ nggu umbɔ ri ivang hã Uyesu aka aba. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Nggee angwɛ̃ imesa ha agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn inyãmɛn Uteijee.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Bɔr Utoma agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iba isi inyãmum ughwee akusa ra aboknga, ni ishɔmu itokmum ru ughwee akusa ha, ikɛi ni ishɔmu ubokmum ru ughwee asawa ha ri igbɔmnga, umum isi íwemum ri imangmang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Inuma utɔrɔk iki itɔng angwɛ̃ imesa ha akɔng ri iya ha, ikɛi Utoma awu nggu umbɔ. Angwĩ ubã agbang, bɔr Uyesu aba adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra ateumbɔ na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ididɔɔr ima iwe nggu umbi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr Utoma agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsu itokngo ru ungɛɛ, unyã abokmum. Unamu ubokngo ushɔma ri igbɔmmum. Uneke icicang, bɔr uwe ru imangmang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Utoma agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijeemum nu Unummum!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo unyã umum ngge itsu ungo uwe ru imangmang. Idorh iwe nggu abirabɛ aka asi inyãmbɔ umum bɔr ana awembɔ ri imangmang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awu use utsu umbɔ atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Uyesu akorhe atsar abin idzeu arhɛrhɛ ra asu angwɛ̃ imesanga, akirakɛ umbɔ aka asi itsɛngmbɔ ru ubvur uwurɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Bɔr atsɛng akɛrɛ ru umbi awe ru imangmang ugɛ Uyesu unga awu Ukiristo, Ungwɛ̃ Unum, mɔcɛ ru ubok imangmang ru unga, umbi ama akpo urhɛ ri itsoknga.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu nu idzeu iyiki idzui abɛrh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Akɛrɛ ha aka amaa, Uyesu abvui adzeka ra angwɛ̃ imesanga nú ubang ukau ukugɔng ukpu Utibariya. Riminɛ ngge iki ikorhe. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Usiman Ubitru nu Utoma, uwuruwi ha umbɔ iki iyisa Akãrhghwɛ̃, nu Unataniyerh aka adzeku Ukana ukpu Ugarhirhi, nu angwɛ̃ Uzabadi, nu ikɛi angwɛ̃ imesa abɔɔ avaa awu urhɔnga. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Ubitru agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwuri idze izĩ udɛm.&gt;&gt; Angwɛ̃ imesa abika abɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn izĩmɛn nggu ungo.&gt;&gt; Nggee umbɔ adzek atsĩ ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ azĩmbɔ. Bɔr ru utsuu ukpu ha umbɔ asi idzurmbɔ ubin.<verse eid="JHN 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Ivang ukpe uku usar, umbɔ akpurha anyã Uyesu aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ ri ifɛn ukau ukugɔng hã, bɔr angwɛ̃ imesa ha asi ihwɛngmbɔ ugɛ awu Uyesu.<verse eid="JHN 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Uyesu ayisa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi awɛrhamum, umbi awembi ra abɛrh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka atang igbermbi udiku ubok ugha ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ hã, umbi awuri ikpombi akɔɔ.&gt;&gt; Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka atang, umbɔ asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ adarhumbɔ igber ha ubinkutsu, arhɛrha abɛrha amor.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Mɔcɛ ungwɛ̃ imesa ha uwu Uyesu aka abema agɔr Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu Uteijee!&gt;&gt; Ivang Usiman Ubitru aka agũ agɛ awu Uteijee, unga anyangu untamanga uwuruwi unga aka atsimuwe, atama na ater isha atsĩã ra amɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Angwɛ̃ imesa abika abɔr igambɔ azĩmbɔ ru ubang ukau ukugɔng ru ukhukhɔɔ ha, agbĩrhã nggu igber ha iki itɔk nggu abɛrh ha. Umbɔ asi idermbɔ nggu abĩ ubang ukau ha, awu ru nyaki ivarha adaka anaka ataar (300). <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Ivang umbɔ aka adzeka nú abĩã, umbɔ anyã akãã urha ra anang hã nu abɛrh nú ake, nu uborodi.<verse eid="JHN 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka akũ abɛrh akɔɔ aba ra akirakɛ umbi aka adzui icicɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Usiman Ubitru afũ ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ hã agbiir igber ha akũ azĩ ri ifɛn ukau ha. Igber ha itɔk nggu nggaa abɛrh unaka ni isɔka itɔ̃ɔ̃ nu ataar (153). Bɔr kishoo nu irhɛ abɛrh ha riminɛ, igber ha isi ipupungge. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka aba atsu ukpee.&gt;&gt; Ra angwɛ̃ imesa ha, unera asi iwea ri ikeramɛn iyiki irhusa unga ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu ungamɔ?&gt;&gt; Umbɔ ahwɛngmbɔ agɛ awu Uteijee. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Uyesu aba anyangu uborodi adzowe umbɔ, na akorhe rimi nggu abɛrh ha. <verse eid="JHN 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Uyesu aka asok ra akpe, ide untaar riyɛ unga aka adzeyiwa ra angwɛ̃ imesanga.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu nggu Ubitru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka amaa itsukpee, Uyesu agɔr Usiman Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Usiman ungwɛ̃ Uyohana, ungo ubema umum unango ibibemayɛ abɛrɛ aka abema umum?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ, Uteijee, ungo uhwɛngo umum iki ibema ungo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ufuka angwɛ̃ itsurhimum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Uyesu abvui arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Usiman ungwɛ̃ Uyohana, idzidzɛrhe ungo ubemungo umum?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ, Uteijee, ungo uhwɛngo ugɛ umum ĩbemum ungo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Urhisa ídɔimum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Uyesu arhusa unga ide untaar agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Usiman ungwɛ̃ Uyohana, ungo ubemungo umum?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Amɛn Ubitru aghong, Uyesu aka arhusa unga idikũnga itaar agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo ubemungo umum?&gt;&gt; Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, ungo uhwɛngo abina kishoo, ungo uhwɛngo ugɛ umum ĩbemum ungo.&gt;&gt; Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ufukuwa ídɔimum. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Umum indɛyiwa ungo idzidzɛrhe, ivangyɛ ungo uku uwu uwɛdzɛm, ungo iki isaku utsim abinngo nibikango nu uzĩ anangkɛ ungo uku ubee. Bɔr ivangyɛ ungo uba ukɔ̃ɔ̃ ungo uwuri ibera abokngo nu uwɔɔ atsima ungo atorho na akũna ungo azĩ anangkɛ ungo uku usi ibeengo izizĩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Uyesu arherhe rimi unga adɛyiwe ikpũ akpe Ubitru aka awuri ikpe akpoi Unum. Mɔcɛ unga agɔr Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;Udɔsa umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu nu ungwɛ̃ imesa uwɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Ubitru adzipa arhi undzing anyã ungwɛ̃ imesa ha, uwuruwi Uyesu aka abema aka adɔsa umbɔ. Uwɛrɛ ha unga awu ungwɛ̃ imesa ha uwuku ufata ri ikɔ Uyesu ri ivang iki igha Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng na arhusu Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, awu ungamɔ awuri igha adakngo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Ivang Ubitru aka anyã unga, unga arhusu Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, utsak uwurɛ awu use ikorhe nggu unga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iba ibee unga abɛk utsɛku umum iki ibvui iba, awu use awe akingo? Awu ufang ungo udɔsa umum!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Akɛrɛ ha atsu arherhe ha atɛ̃rhã ra abika adɔsu Uyesu ugɛ ungwɛ̃ imesa ha asi íkpea. Bɔr Uyesu asi igɔra ugɛ asi íkpea, agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iba ibee unga abɛk utsɛku umum iki ibvui iba, awu use awe akingo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Uwɛrɛ ha unga awu ungwɛ̃ imesa ha aka ani idzowe ideka ra abin akɛrɛ, ikɛi unga atsɛng ake. Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn idekanga iwu idzidzɛrhe.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Bɔr abin akɔɔ arhɛrhɛ Uyesu aka akorhe. Agɛ umbɔ atsɛngmbɔ ubɛn ubin, umum ikaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ upfunga kishoo usi íwekpɔ ru ubã ukpuku udɛ̃ɛ̃ unyanga abvurkɛ umbɔ aka itsɛng.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
